*Between making dinner, talking without pause, and recalling memories best left forgotten, Mirari has quickly depleted what energy she had left.*

1387
01:43:38,000 --> 01:43:48,000
*(I figured Mirari had her reasons for not wanting to tell me about her situation, but it looks like once she got started, she just couldn't stop.)*

1388
01:43:48,000 --> 01:43:54,000
*(Who knows how long she's been holding all of that in, wanting to get it off her chest?)*

1389
01:43:54,000 --> 01:44:02,000
*(I may not know much about half-wolves, but I get the feeling from her story that they aren't exactly the touchy-feely type.)*

1390
01:44:02,000 --> 01:44:03,000
Fuyu:  "Mmmm..."

1391
01:44:03,000 --> 01:44:06,000
Fuyu:  "What's all this racket about?"

1392
01:44:06,000 --> 01:44:08,000
Fuyu:  "{i}*yawwwn*{/i}"

1393
01:44:08,000 --> 01:44:14,000
*Awakened by Mirari's story, Fuyu raises her head and begins to rub her eyes sleepily.*

1394
01:44:14,000 --> 01:44:15,000
Fuyu:  "...Hmm?"

1395
01:44:15,000 --> 01:44:17,000
Fuyu:  "Oh. Morning, princess."

1396
01:44:17,000 --> 01:44:20,000
Mirari:  "Heehee. Good evening, Fuyu."

1397
01:44:20,000 --> 01:44:21,000
Fuyu:  "Mmm."

1398
01:44:21,000 --> 01:44:22,000
Fuyu:  "...Evening?"

1399
01:44:22,000 --> 01:44:27,000
Mirari:  "That's right. And I'm not the first one you should be greeting."

1400
01:44:27,000 --> 01:44:28,000
Fuyu:  "Huh?"

1401
01:44:28,000 --> 01:44:31,000
*Fuyu raises an eyebrow as Mirari giggles.*

1402
01:44:31,000 --> 01:44:36,000
*Rather than wait for Fuyu to notice me, I place my hand on her shoulder.*

1403
01:44:36,000 --> 01:44:38,000
You:  "Are you awake now, Fuyu?"

1404
01:44:38,000 --> 01:44:39,000
Fuyu:  "Wha!?"

1405
01:44:39,000 --> 01:44:42,000
*Fuyu tries to jump back in surprise.*

1406
01:44:42,000 --> 01:44:50,000
*However, since she's still sitting on my lap, her action serves only to bring the two of us even closer together.*

1407
01:44:50,000 --> 01:44:53,000
Fuyu:  "Wh-Wh-Why am I...!? Why is the human...!?"

1408
01:44:53,000 --> 01:44:59,000
*Fuyu's face turns bright red in an instant as she realizes where she is, and what she's doing.*

1409
01:44:59,000 --> 01:45:01,000
Fuyu:  "D... Dinner...?"

1410
01:45:01,000 --> 01:45:06,000
*At the mention of that magical word, Fuyu begins to sniff the air.*

1411
01:45:06,000 --> 01:45:10,000
Fuyu:  "Oh... Ohhhh! Right! Of course! That's what it is!"

1412
01:45:10,000 --> 01:45:16,000
Fuyu:  "I was just hungry and tired, and your lap was warm, so I naturally fell asleep on it."

1413
01:45:16,000 --> 01:45:23,000
Fuyu:  "Silly me. Of course that's what happened! Why else would I be napping in a place like this?"

1414
01:45:23,000 --> 01:45:29,000
Fuyu:  "If that weren't the case, I'd never be caught sleeping on your smelly lap."

1415
01:45:29,000 --> 01:45:32,000
You:  "You don't need to get so defensive, Fuyu."

1416
01:45:32,000 --> 01:45:34,000
Fuyu:  "I'm not getting defensive!"

1417
01:45:34,000 --> 01:45:38,000
Fuyu:  "I just don't want you to misunderstand, that's all!"

1418
01:45:38,000 --> 01:45:45,000
*Fuyu finally removes herself from my lap and runs over to the kitchen, lured in by the smell of food.*

1419
01:45:45,000 --> 01:45:53,000
*Even after she reached the food, Fuyu steals a few glances in my direction, then quickly averts her gaze when I catch her.*

1420
01:45:53,000 --> 01:45:55,000
Mirari:  "I guess that's my cue."

1421
01:45:55,000 --> 01:46:00,000
Mirari:  "I'll bring dinner over in a moment. Just sit tight, [player_name]."

1422
01:46:00,000 --> 01:46:08,000
*Having filled our bellies, Mirari, Fuyu and I sit down on the couch once again as we ponder what to do with ourselves.*

1423
01:46:08,000 --> 01:46:13,000
*After napping earlier in the day, Fuyu and I are still full of energy.*

1424
01:46:13,000 --> 01:46:21,000
*Mirari, on the other hand, seems like she'll fall asleep at any moment, and is hanging on by sheer force of will.*

1425
01:46:21,000 --> 01:46:23,000
Mirari:  "Fuahhh... Mmm..."

1426
01:46:23,000 --> 01:46:27,000
Mirari:  "Really, I'm fine. I'll go to bed when you do."

1427
01:46:27,000 --> 01:46:32,000
You:  "That would sound more convincing without the yawn at the start."

1428
01:46:32,000 --> 01:46:36,000
You:  "Go to bed, Mirari. You aren't going to miss anything."

1429
01:46:36,000 --> 01:46:39,000
Mirari:  "But I don't {i}*yawn*{/i} feel tired..."

1430
01:46:39,000 --> 01:46:41,000
You:  "You're a terrible liar."

1431
01:46:41,000 --> 01:46:45,000
You:  "{i}sigh...{/i} Fine. Stay up, for all I care."

1432
01:46:45,000 --> 01:46:49,000
You:  "I was just going to watch some old VHS tapes anyway."

1433
01:46:49,000 --> 01:46:51,000
Mirari:  "Vee haych ess?"

1434
01:46:51,000 --> 01:46:55,000
Mirari:  "What is that? I've never heard of it before."

1435
01:46:55,000 --> 01:46:58,000
You:  "Yeah, most people under twenty haven't."

1436
01:46:58,000 --> 01:47:03,000
You:  "It's a way for humans to watch movies and TV shows whenever they want."

1437
01:47:03,000 --> 01:47:09,000
You:  "It's a bit dated now, but they still work, as long as you have the right equipment."

1438
01:47:09,000 --> 01:47:11,000
Mirari:  "Movies and... tee vee?"

1439
01:47:11,000 --> 01:47:16,000
Mirari:  "Fuyu, do you understand what [player_name] is talking about?"

1440
01:47:16,000 --> 01:47:19,000
Fuyu:  "Mmm... I think I've heard of tee vee."

1441
01:47:19,000 --> 01:47:23,000
Fuyu:  "That's the magic box with moving pictures, isn't it?"

1442
01:47:23,000 --> 01:47:25,000
You:  "You're not wrong, but..."

1443
01:47:25,000 --> 01:47:29,000
You:  "Do you girls seriously not know what television is?"

1444
01:47:29,000 --> 01:47:35,000
You:  "How could you be familiar with canned food and running water, but not television?"

1445
01:47:35,000 --> 01:47:38,000
Mirari:  "Mmm... Even if you ask that..."

1446
01:47:38,000 --> 01:47:42,000
Fuyu:  "Well, what does "television" do that's so special?"

1447
01:47:42,000 --> 01:47:48,000
Fuyu:  "Running water and canned food provide us with sustenance. Why do we need television?"

1448
01:47:48,000 --> 01:47:49,000
You:  "Ahh... uhm..."

1449
01:47:49,000 --> 01:47:52,000
You:  "You actually do have a point there."

1450
01:47:52,000 --> 01:47:57,000
You:  "Television has a couple of uses, but it's mostly for entertainment."

1451
01:47:57,000 --> 01:48:03,000
*I pull out a box filled with VHS tapes and place it in front of the two wolf-girls.*

1452
01:48:03,000 --> 01:48:09,000
*Inside of the box are dozens of tapes, still in their original cases, cover art and all.*

1453
01:48:09,000 --> 01:48:11,000
Mirari:  "These are vee haych ess?"

1454
01:48:11,000 --> 01:48:12,000
You:  "That's right."

1455
01:48:12,000 --> 01:48:16,000
You:  "Pick one you like the look of and we'll see what's on it."

1456
01:48:16,000 --> 01:48:17,000
Mirari:  "Okay!"

1457
01:48:17,000 --> 01:48:21,000
*Mirari and Fuyu start looking through the box of old tapes.*

1458
01:48:21,000 --> 01:48:26,000
*After searching for a few seconds, they each pull out a single tape.*

1459
01:48:26,000 --> 01:48:29,000
You:  "Let's see what you've got there..."

1460
01:48:29,000 --> 01:48:33,000
You:  "A documentary about animals of the grasslands?"

1461
01:48:33,000 --> 01:48:38,000
Mirari:  "Yes! I'm quite curious to see how those in other climates thrive."

1462
01:48:38,000 --> 01:48:43,000
You:  "I suppose you would be, if you've lived in the snow your entire life."

1463
01:48:43,000 --> 01:48:45,000
You:  "What about you, Fuyu?"

1464
01:48:45,000 --> 01:48:50,000
Fuyu:  "Mmm... I'm not sure I wanna watch it, but the cover did catch my eye."

1465
01:48:50,000 --> 01:48:53,000
You:  "That's okay. Show me what you've--"

1466
01:48:53,000 --> 01:48:54,000
You:  "Pfft!"

1467
01:48:54,000 --> 01:48:59,000
*I almost gag on my own saliva as I gaze upon the tape in Fuyu's hand.*

1468
01:48:59,000 --> 01:49:06,000
*On the cover is a young, blond woman with a large chest, dressed in nothing but a revealing swimsuit.*

1469
01:49:06,000 --> 01:49:17,000
*Unlike the grasslands documentary, which is still in its original plastic sleeve, this video has been viewed so many times that the tape is beginning to wear out.*

1470
01:49:17,000 --> 01:49:20,000
Mirari:  "Oh? What manner of vee haych ess is that?"

1471
01:49:20,000 --> 01:49:23,000
Mirari:  "Are we going to view that next?"

1472
01:49:23,000 --> 01:49:25,000
You:  "No! I-I mean, uhh..."

1473
01:49:25,000 --> 01:49:32,000
You:  "This one would bore the two of you to death. It's not the kind of thing you'd be interested in."

1474
01:49:32,000 --> 01:49:33,000
Mirari:  "Really?"

1475
01:49:33,000 --> 01:49:36,000
Fuyu:  "I did get the feeling I wouldn't like it."

1476
01:49:36,000 --> 01:49:39,000
Fuyu:  "So it's a boring one after all, huh?"

1477
01:49:39,000 --> 01:49:41,000
You:  "O-Oh, yes. Quite boring."

1478
01:49:41,000 --> 01:49:48,000
You:  "I'll just put it back in the box, wayyy at the bottom, so we don't wind up picking it out again."

1479
01:49:48,000 --> 01:49:49,000
Mirari:  "Huh..."

1480
01:49:49,000 --> 01:49:55,000
*I breathe a sigh of relief as the two wolf-girls allow my slip-up to pass without a fight.*

1481
01:49:55,000 --> 01:50:01,000
*(Looks like I'll need to be more careful with that stuff as long as these two are here.)*

1482
01:50:01,000 --> 01:50:08,000
*(I've been able to do things at my own pace until now, but I can't be so careless when guests are over.)*

1483
01:50:08,000 --> 01:50:14,000
*Rather than dwell on Fuyu's discovery, I hurriedly cram Mirari's choice into the VHS player.*

1484
01:50:14,000 --> 01:50:25,000
*After skipping through the ads, anti-piracy warnings, and other outdated product placements, I start the movie where the film crew are just beginning to set up.*

1485
01:50:25,000 --> 01:50:35,000
*The first few minutes of the film explain how the crew are looking for specific animals during today's outing, and how they plan to observe each one.*

1486
01:50:35,000 --> 01:50:43,000
*Whether they'll succeed or not is yet to be seen. All they promise is to not hurt the animals, and to view them from afar.*

1487
01:50:43,000 --> 01:50:45,000
Mirari:  "Oooh~ Look at that!"

1488
01:50:45,000 --> 01:50:52,000
Mirari:  "The water is flowing in a perfectly straight line, without any chunks of ice floating in it at all."

1489
01:50:52,000 --> 01:50:58,000
Mirari:  "And the grass! It's everywhere! There isn't a single patch of snow to be seen."

1490
01:50:58,000 --> 01:51:02,000
Fuyu:  "You're right, princess. This is truly fascinating."

1491
01:51:02,000 --> 01:51:11,000
Fuyu:  "With ready access to unfrozen water, do the animals living in those parts drink their fill and bathe whenever they feel the urge?"

1492
01:51:11,000 --> 01:51:15,000
Mirari:  "I imagine they must. Why else would they--"

1493
01:51:15,000 --> 01:51:20,000
Mirari:  "Oh! Look! Fuyu, look! The rabbit is drinking from the river!"

1494
01:51:20,000 --> 01:51:22,000
Fuyu:  "I see it, princess!"

1495
01:51:22,000 --> 01:51:28,000
Fuyu:  "But where has all of its fur gone? It will never survive the winter like that."

1496
01:51:28,000 --> 01:51:32,000
You:  "You're the last person who should be asking that."

1497
01:51:32,000 --> 01:51:37,000
*I smile wryly as the two girls excitedly point towards the television.*

1498
01:51:37,000 --> 01:51:44,000
*Even Fuyu, who generally attempts to feign disinterest in such things, is clearly enjoying herself.*

1499
01:51:44,000 --> 01:51:47,000
*So far, movie night is a resounding success.*

1500
01:51:47,000 --> 01:51:50,000
Fuyu:  "Huh? Where did all of the animals go?"

1501
01:51:50,000 --> 01:51:53,000
Fuyu:  "Why are they only showing humans now?"

1502
01:51:53,000 --> 01:52:00,000
You:  "Ah, it looks like they're taking a break and discussing how they're going to track down the next animal."

1503
01:52:00,000 --> 01:52:01,000
Fuyu:  "Boooring!"

1504
01:52:01,000 --> 01:52:03,000
You:  "...I agree, actually."

1505
01:52:03,000 --> 01:52:06,000
Mirari:  "I don't. I find this fascinating."

1506
01:52:06,000 --> 01:52:12,000
Mirari:  "The humans are all huddling together to hold a strategy meeting, just like we would!"

1507
01:52:12,000 --> 01:52:18,000
You:  "I think the people you're watching might claim that you have that backwards."

1508
01:52:18,000 --> 01:52:20,000
Mirari:  "Oh, look! A human city!"

1509
01:52:20,000 --> 01:52:24,000
Fuyu:  "Yuck. They're even further away from the grasslands now."

1510
01:52:24,000 --> 01:52:29,000
You:  "Ah... They're going back to the studio to talk with some expert."

1511
01:52:29,000 --> 01:52:32,000
Mirari:  "My, that building is enormous!"

1512
01:52:32,000 --> 01:52:35,000
Mirari:  "Are most human buildings as big as that?"

1513
01:52:35,000 --> 01:52:41,000
Mirari:  "Oh, and the number of people! I've never {i}seen{/i} so many human beings before now!"

1514
01:52:41,000 --> 01:52:44,000
Mirari:  "How nice it must be to live there..."

1515
01:52:44,000 --> 01:52:50,000
You:  "We can continue watching the video some other time. For now, let's all go to bed."

1516
01:52:50,000 --> 01:52:54,000
Mirari:  "Fuahhh... But I want to talk about human civilization."

1517
01:52:54,000 --> 01:52:59,000
Fuyu:  "O-Oh, good idea, human. Or rather, that's exactly what I was thinking."

1518
01:52:59,000 --> 01:53:02,000
Fuyu:  "Come here, princess. Let us go to sleep."

1519
01:53:02,000 --> 01:53:05,000
Mirari:  "Mmmnn... Okay then. If you insist."

1520
01:53:05,000 --> 01:53:07,000
Mirari:  "Good night, [player_name]."

1521
01:53:07,000 --> 01:53:09,000
You:  "Good night, Mirari, Fuyu."

1522
01:53:09,000 --> 01:53:11,000
Fuyu:  "G... Good night."

1523
01:53:11,000 --> 01:53:16,000
*Without further complaint, Mirari curls up on the couch alongside Fuyu.*

1524
01:53:16,000 --> 01:53:22,000
*Fuyu soon joins her and snuggles up close, as if making up for their dissonance moments ago.*

1525
01:53:22,000 --> 01:53:28,000
*Content to leave the duo just like that, I retreat to my bedroom and head to bed myself.*

1526
01:53:28,000 --> 01:53:34,000
*Having napped for a while yesterday evening, I wake up earlier than usual this morning.*

1527
01:53:34,000 --> 01:53:41,000
*Long before my largely unnecessary alarm clock can wake me up, I rise from my bed and begin to stretch.*

1528
01:53:41,000 --> 01:53:48,000
*Unfortunately, even though I've awoken early, there's no reason for me to be awake at such a time.*

1529
01:53:48,000 --> 01:53:55,000
*It isn't yet warm enough to work, and there are no time-sensitive activities in my list of things to do.*

1530
01:53:55,000 --> 01:53:58,000
*All I've done is deny myself a sleep-in.*

1531
01:53:58,000 --> 01:54:02,000
You:  "{i}haa...{/i} I guess I'll go check on the girls."

1532
01:54:02,000 --> 01:54:06,000
You:  "Maybe they have something they want to do this morning?"

1533
01:54:06,000 --> 01:54:14,000
*I walk into the living room, half expecting to see Mirari cooking, and Fuyu sitting on the floor behind her impatiently.*

1534
01:54:14,000 --> 01:54:16,000
*Surprisingly, however--*

1535
01:54:16,000 --> 01:54:18,000
Mirari:  "{i}zzz... zz...{/i}"

1536
01:54:18,000 --> 01:54:19,000
Fuyu:  "Mmmm..."

1537
01:54:19,000 --> 01:54:22,000
*The two wolf-girls are yet to awaken.*

1538
01:54:22,000 --> 01:54:25,000
You:  "Huh. Looks like I'm the first one up."

1539
01:54:25,000 --> 01:54:30,000
You:  "I guess they're too comfortable to move, the way they are now."

1540
01:54:30,000 --> 01:54:36,000
*Watching over the two for a moment, a smile naturally begins to creep onto my face.*

1541
01:54:36,000 --> 01:54:46,000
*Mirari and Fuyu, snuggled together. Sharing one another's body warmth, resting on the other's fur, and generally finding pleasure in being with the other.*

1542
01:54:46,000 --> 01:54:50,000
*If not for the cuteness of their action, I'd probably be jealous.*

1543
01:54:50,000 --> 01:54:54,000
You:  "What am I thinking? This is nothing to be jealous of."

1544
01:54:54,000 --> 01:55:00,000
You:  "In fact, I should be thinking of ways to get rid of them even one day sooner."

1545
01:55:00,000 --> 01:55:06,000
You:  "It's for their sake and mine that we go our separate ways as soon as possible."

1546
01:55:06,000 --> 01:55:13,000
You:  "Everyone knows that humans and half-humans aren't supposed to get involved with one another."

1547
01:55:13,000 --> 01:55:22,000
You:  "We're too different, and having one try to integrate into the society of the other will only result in pain for both sides."

1548
01:55:22,000 --> 01:55:29,000
*Over the years, many cautionary tales have been told regarding humans and half-humans getting along.*

1549
01:55:29,000 --> 01:55:34,000
*Humans feeding starving half-humans, only to then become their dessert.*

1550
01:55:34,000 --> 01:55:42,000
*Half-humans seeking refuge in human homes, then ultimately slaughtering the families within and stealing their shelter.*

1551
01:55:42,000 --> 01:55:51,000
*There have even been cases of mass-killings on both sides, starting with nothing more than subtle differences in their ways of life.*

1552
01:55:51,000 --> 01:56:01,000
*In hindsight, I've taken on a pretty substantial risk by taking a half-wolf, a member of one of the most aggressive and bestial races, into my home.*

1553
01:56:01,000 --> 01:56:09,000
You:  "That being said... looking at these two right now, it's pretty hard to imagine either one of them turning on me."

1554
01:56:09,000 --> 01:56:19,000
You:  "Hell, Mirari acts more human than most of the people I've ever known, and she certainly knows her way around the kitchen better than I do."

1555
01:56:19,000 --> 01:56:21,000
You:  "...Speaking of which..."

1556
01:56:21,000 --> 01:56:29,000
*Prying myself away from the adorable sight, I walk into the storeroom in search of something easy to cook for breakfast.*

1557
01:56:29,000 --> 01:56:35,000
*When I start to prod around in the storeroom, however, I quickly realize something important.*

1558
01:56:35,000 --> 01:56:38,000
You:  "Oh man. Where did all of the food go?"

1559
01:56:38,000 --> 01:56:41,000
You:  "I thought I had enough to last until Summer."

1560
01:56:41,000 --> 01:56:48,000
You:  "I know those two eat a lot more than I do, but we shouldn't have gone through that much food already."

1561
01:56:48,000 --> 01:56:50,000
*Perplexed, I scratch my head.*

1562
01:56:50,000 --> 01:57:01,000
*It's possible that Mirari may have moved the rest of the supplies when she was cleaning up, but without knowing where she moved them to, that thought does me little good.*

1563
01:57:01,000 --> 01:57:05,000
You:  "I guess I'll go make a trip into town after all."

1564
01:57:05,000 --> 01:57:11,000
You:  "I was hoping to put this off until Summer, but in a way, this might be for the best."

1565
01:57:11,000 --> 01:57:20,000
You:  "A more up to date map would be helpful, after all, and I do need to gather information about the recent changes to the terrain."

1566
01:57:20,000 --> 01:57:23,000
You:  "{i}sigh...{/i} Off to town I go then."

1567
01:57:23,000 --> 01:57:28,000
*Without dallying any further, I grab my keys and head to the side of the house.*

1568
01:57:28,000 --> 01:57:33,000
*I then jump into my truck, turn the key, and start to rev up the engine.*

1569
01:57:33,000 --> 01:57:36,000
You:  "Ahh, come on, you stupid thing."

1570
01:57:36,000 --> 01:57:40,000
You:  "It hasn't been that long since I last drove you."

1571
01:57:40,000 --> 01:57:44,000
*I continue to rev the engine in an attempt to warm the truck up.*

1572
01:57:44,000 --> 01:57:50,000
*Unfortunately, my efforts seem to result in nothing but an increased level of noise.*

1573
01:57:50,000 --> 01:57:53,000
You:  "Come on, you good for nothing--"

1574
01:57:53,000 --> 01:57:54,000
Fuyu:  "Grrrr...!!"

1575
01:57:54,000 --> 01:57:55,000
You:  "...Huh?"

1576
01:57:55,000 --> 01:57:56,000
Mirari:  "Arf! Arf!"

1577
01:57:56,000 --> 01:57:58,000
Mirari:  "Hmm... {i}*whine*{/i}"

1578
01:57:58,000 --> 01:58:00,000
Fuyu:  "Grrr.... Ruff! Ruff!"

1579
01:58:00,000 --> 01:58:03,000
Fuyu:  "S-Stay away from the princess, you...!"

1580
01:58:03,000 --> 01:58:04,000
You:  "...The hell?"

1581
01:58:04,000 --> 01:58:09,000
*I turn to look towards the house only to find that I've awoken my guests.*

1582
01:58:09,000 --> 01:58:15,000
*Rather than address me personally, however, the two girls seem to be fixated on my truck.*

1583
01:58:15,000 --> 01:58:18,000
Mirari:  "F-Fuyu, look! It has [player_name]!"

1584
01:58:18,000 --> 01:58:20,000
Fuyu:  "Tch. It does too."

1585
01:58:20,000 --> 01:58:24,000
Mirari:  "B-Be careful, Fuyu! We don't know what it's capable of!"

1586
01:58:24,000 --> 01:58:27,000
Fuyu:  "Don't worry, princess. I've got this."

1587
01:58:27,000 --> 01:58:29,000
*Fuyu slowly approaches.*

1588
01:58:29,000 --> 01:58:35,000
*Her hair is standing on end, her claws are ready by her sides, and her teeth are bared.*

1589
01:58:35,000 --> 01:58:37,000
Mirari:  "I-I'll help too!"

1590
01:58:37,000 --> 01:58:40,000
Mirari:  "We're coming for you, [player_name]!"

1591
01:58:40,000 --> 01:58:43,000
*Right behind her, Mirari steps forward warily.*

1592
01:58:43,000 --> 01:58:50,000
*Armed with a frying pan from the kitchen, Mirari looks like a frightened housewife rather than a wolf.*

1593
01:58:50,000 --> 01:58:58,000
*Nonetheless, she comes forth bravely, ready to fight my truck for the sake of freeing the person trapped within.*

1594
01:58:58,000 --> 01:59:00,000
You:  "Girls, please, stop that."

1595
01:59:00,000 --> 01:59:04,000
You:  "I'm sorry I scared you, but I'm fine. Really."

1596
01:59:04,000 --> 01:59:08,000
You:  "And Fuyu, you've seen my truck before, remember?"

1597
01:59:08,000 --> 01:59:13,000
Fuyu:  "Grrr... I can still hear the human speak from within its belly."

1598
01:59:13,000 --> 01:59:16,000
Mirari:  "[player_name] must still be okay!"

1599
01:59:16,000 --> 01:59:18,000
Fuyu:  "Yeah, but not for long."

1600
01:59:18,000 --> 01:59:20,000
Mirari:  "H-How do we do that?"

1601
01:59:20,000 --> 01:59:23,000
Mirari:  "Do you know how to fight this thing?"

1602
01:59:23,000 --> 01:59:28,000
Fuyu:  "No... but I'd wager that it's no different than any other beast."

1603
01:59:28,000 --> 01:59:32,000
Fuyu:  "Tear its throat out with your teeth and it'll die."

1604
01:59:32,000 --> 01:59:35,000
Mirari:  "T-Tear its...! I-I couldn't possibly!"

1605
01:59:35,000 --> 01:59:38,000
Fuyu:  "Don't worry, princess. I'll do it."

1606
01:59:38,000 --> 01:59:40,000
You:  "No, don't you do it either!"

1607
01:59:40,000 --> 01:59:43,000
You:  "Just go back into the cabin, okay?"

1608
01:59:43,000 --> 01:59:48,000
You:  "This hunk of junk is nothing for you to get worked up about."

1609
01:59:48,000 --> 01:59:49,000
Mirari:  "...Fuyu?"

1610
01:59:49,000 --> 01:59:57,000
Fuyu:  "Don't listen to it, princess. The beast is mimicking [player_name]'s voice so that we'll let our guard down."

1611
01:59:57,000 --> 02:00:00,000
Fuyu:  "As soon as we turn our backs, it'll pounce."

1612
02:00:00,000 --> 02:00:01,000
Mirari:  "Eep!"

1613
02:00:01,000 --> 02:00:03,000
You:  "Oh, for the love of..."

1614
02:00:03,000 --> 02:00:09,000
*Before Fuyu can scratch the paint on my truck, I turn the engine off and hop out.*

1615
02:00:09,000 --> 02:00:12,000
You:  "Look, I keep telling you, I'm fi--"

1616
02:00:12,000 --> 02:00:13,000
You:  "Woah!"

1617
02:00:13,000 --> 02:00:15,000
Mirari:  "[player_name]!"

1618
02:00:15,000 --> 02:00:19,000
Mirari:  "Oh, thank goodness you're alright! I was so scared!"

1619
02:00:19,000 --> 02:00:28,000
Mirari:  "I heard a ferocious rumbling the moment I woke up, and when I came out to see what it was, the beast had already eaten you whole!"

1620
02:00:28,000 --> 02:00:32,000
Mirari:  "I thought we were too late, and that you... that you..."

1621
02:00:32,000 --> 02:00:36,000
*I exhale deeply and place my hand on Mirari's head.*

1622
02:00:36,000 --> 02:00:38,000
You:  "There, there. It's alright."

1623
02:00:38,000 --> 02:00:41,000
You:  "This thing is nothing to be worried about."

1624
02:00:41,000 --> 02:00:44,000
Mirari:  "But [player_name]... {i}*sniff*{/i}"

1625
02:00:44,000 --> 02:00:45,000
Fuyu:  "Grrr..."

1626
02:00:45,000 --> 02:00:47,000
Fuyu:  "...Hah! {i}*prod*{/i}"

1627
02:00:47,000 --> 02:00:49,000
Fuyu:  "Hmm... Is it truly dead?"

1628
02:00:49,000 --> 02:00:52,000
You:  "Fuyu, you don't need to do that."

1629
02:00:52,000 --> 02:00:56,000
You:  "It's a machine, just like the kettle, or the television."

1630
02:00:56,000 --> 02:00:58,000
You:  "It isn't going to hurt you."

1631
02:00:58,000 --> 02:01:00,000
Fuyu:  "Hmph. Like I believe that."

1632
02:01:00,000 --> 02:01:08,000
Fuyu:  "This creature has already devoured you whole once. If it isn't dead, then what is to stop it from doing so again?"

1633
02:01:08,000 --> 02:01:14,000
*I scratch my head in confusion as I try to think of a way to explain to Fuyu how vehicles work.*

1634
02:01:14,000 --> 02:01:22,000
*Given her reaction to the noise and commotion it has generated so far, however, that may be easier said than done.*

1635
02:01:22,000 --> 02:01:24,000
You:  "{i}sigh...{/i} Forget it."

1636
02:01:24,000 --> 02:01:28,000
You:  "You know what? I tamed it. I tamed the beast."

1637
02:01:28,000 --> 02:01:32,000
You:  "It's under my control now. It won't harm anyone ever again."

1638
02:01:32,000 --> 02:01:33,000
Fuyu:  "Oh... I see."

1639
02:01:33,000 --> 02:01:36,000
Mirari:  "Amazing! As expected of [player_name]!"

1640
02:01:36,000 --> 02:01:42,000
*(They won't accept that it's a machine, but they bought that explanation straight away?)*

1641
02:01:42,000 --> 02:01:43,000
*(Good grief.)*

1642
02:01:43,000 --> 02:01:51,000
*Already far more exhausted than I should be, given the time of day, I sigh once more and walk the girls back inside.*

1643
02:01:51,000 --> 02:01:54,000
You:  "Phew. Alright, girls, I'm back."

1644
02:01:54,000 --> 02:02:01,000
You:  "I have enough canned food to last for three Winters. Even taking into account Fuyu's appetite."

1645
02:02:01,000 --> 02:02:06,000
You:  "I also bought a new map and some rechargeable batteries for the radio."

1646
02:02:06,000 --> 02:02:09,000
You:  "Who wants to help me unload the truck?"

1647
02:02:09,000 --> 02:02:11,000
*(Preferably without attacking it.)*

1648
02:02:11,000 --> 02:02:12,000
*......*

1649
02:02:12,000 --> 02:02:13,000
You:  "Girls?"

1650
02:02:13,000 --> 02:02:17,000
*I enter the cabin, surprised to find it both quiet and empty.*

1651
02:02:17,000 --> 02:02:25,000
*As I walk through the cabin, I soon hear the sound of someone talking, though I can't yet make out what they're saying.*

1652
02:02:25,000 --> 02:02:26,000
You:  "Girls...?"

1653
02:02:26,000 --> 02:02:30,000
Fuyu:  "That's why I'm telling you, we need to go {i}now{/i}!"

1654
02:02:30,000 --> 02:02:35,000
Fuyu:  "What do you think is going to happen if we keep wasting our time here?"

1655
02:02:35,000 --> 02:02:42,000
Fuyu:  "Do you think your mother is going to live forever, and she'll just keep on doing your duty for you?"

1656
02:02:42,000 --> 02:02:45,000
Mirari:  "I... I know it isn't fair on my mother..."

1657
02:02:45,000 --> 02:02:49,000
Mirari:  "I know I should return, if only for her sake... But..."

1658
02:02:49,000 --> 02:02:55,000
Fuyu:  "But what? You'd rather hang out here, playing housewife to some {i}human{/i}?"

1659
02:02:55,000 --> 02:02:57,000
Mirari:  "What's wrong with that!?"

1660
02:02:57,000 --> 02:03:02,000
Mirari:  "I like it here, okay? I enjoy human culture far more than our own!"

1661
02:03:02,000 --> 02:03:10,000
Mirari:  "There's no hunting, or sacrificing the weak. No fighting over food, or warmth, or constant power struggles."

1662
02:03:10,000 --> 02:03:16,000
Mirari:  "So why shouldn't I stay here? What does our pack have to offer that's so special?"

1663
02:03:16,000 --> 02:03:23,000
Fuyu:  "It isn't about what the pack can offer {i}you{/i}. It's about what {i}you{/i} can offer the pack!"

1664
02:03:23,000 --> 02:03:31,000
Fuyu:  "Our kin expect you to lead them, just as your father did before you, and your mother is doing right now."

1665
02:03:31,000 --> 02:03:36,000
Fuyu:  "Are you going to let them all down because of your own selfishness?"

1666
02:03:36,000 --> 02:03:38,000
Mirari:  "Why shouldn't I!?"

1667
02:03:38,000 --> 02:03:47,000
Mirari:  "I'm sick and tired of being everyone's "princess", and being held on some kind of pedestal because of who my father was."

1668
02:03:47,000 --> 02:03:56,000
Mirari:  "I don't want to be a leader! Just because everyone keeps saying I'll be the next pack leader, that doesn't make it true!"

1669
02:03:56,000 --> 02:04:01,000
Mirari:  "All I want is to live out my days in peace, like... like..."

1670
02:04:01,000 --> 02:04:03,000
Mirari:  "Like a human!"

1671
02:04:03,000 --> 02:04:04,000
*{i}*slap*{/i}*

1672
02:04:04,000 --> 02:04:07,000
*The sound of chatter dies down in an instant.*

1673
02:04:07,000 --> 02:04:13,000
*All that can be heard throughout the cabin is the echo of Fuyu's palm striking Mirari's cheek.*

1674
02:04:13,000 --> 02:04:22,000
*Unsure of whether I should step in or not, I remain frozen on the spot, watching silently to see who will make the first move.*

1675
02:04:22,000 --> 02:04:24,000
Mirari:  "I... I'm sorry..."

1676
02:04:24,000 --> 02:04:28,000
Mirari:  "I'm sorry for letting you all down like this..."

1677
02:04:28,000 --> 02:04:32,000
Mirari:  "But my mind is made up. I will not return to the pack."

1678
02:04:32,000 --> 02:04:35,000
Fuyu:  "...Fine. Have it your way, {i}princess{/i}."

1679
02:04:35,000 --> 02:04:41,000
Fuyu:  "We'll be better off without a selfish human-sympathizer like you leading us anyway."

1680
02:04:41,000 --> 02:04:44,000
*Fuyu pushes past Mirari and heads for the door.*

1681
02:04:44,000 --> 02:04:50,000
*Once Fuyu has returned to the cabin, it takes no time at all for the two wolf-girls to make up.*

1682
02:04:50,000 --> 02:04:58,000
*With Mirari taking the lead, both girls are soon in tears, apologizing to one another and wishing to make amends.*

1683
02:04:58,000 --> 02:05:03,000
*I watch on in relief, glad to see the dear friends on good terms once more.*

1684
02:05:03,000 --> 02:05:06,000
*(Maybe the fight wasn't as bad as it sounded.)*

1685
02:05:06,000 --> 02:05:11,000
*(Either that or this isn't the first time they've had that particular fight.)*

1686
02:05:11,000 --> 02:05:15,000
*(Whatever the case, I'm glad those two are getting along again.)*

1687
02:05:15,000 --> 02:05:17,000
Mirari:  "[player_name]."

1688
02:05:17,000 --> 02:05:22,000
*I look down as Mirari leaves Fuyu's side and suddenly addresses me.*

1689
02:05:22,000 --> 02:05:23,000
You:  "Yes, Mirari?"

1690
02:05:23,000 --> 02:05:26,000
Mirari:  "I just wanted to thank you one more time."

1691
02:05:26,000 --> 02:05:28,000
You:  "Thank me? For what?"

1692
02:05:28,000 --> 02:05:32,000
You:  "I didn't do anything. You two made up all on your own."

1693
02:05:32,000 --> 02:05:34,000
*Mirari shakes her head.*

1694
02:05:34,000 --> 02:05:39,000
Mirari:  "Not that... or perhaps I should say, not {i}just{/i} that."

1695
02:05:39,000 --> 02:05:45,000
Mirari:  "[player_name], you've done so much for us, all without asking for a thing in return."

1696
02:05:45,000 --> 02:05:51,000
Mirari:  "That got me thinking... maybe there's something we can do for you after all?"

1697
02:05:51,000 --> 02:05:53,000
You:  "Oh... Okay then."

1698
02:05:53,000 --> 02:06:01,000
You:  "I thought cooking and cleaning already counted as a pretty nice "thank you", but... what do you have in mind?"

1699
02:06:01,000 --> 02:06:05,000
*Mirari and Fuyu look at one another, then nod in agreement.*

1700
02:06:05,000 --> 02:06:07,000
Fuyu:  "You'll see soon enough."

1701
02:06:07,000 --> 02:06:12,000
Fuyu:  "Grab a thick coat. We'd hate to have you freeze to death on the way over."

1702
02:06:12,000 --> 02:06:20,000
*Dressed in a thick coat, I follow the girls outside and head down the path they previously attempted to take home.*

1703
02:06:20,000 --> 02:06:28,000
*From the moment we leave the cabin, Mirari is smiling from ear to ear. Even Fuyu can't completely contain her excitement.*

1704
02:06:28,000 --> 02:06:32,000
*Wherever we're going, it must be somewhere pretty special.*

1705
02:06:32,000 --> 02:06:35,000
You:  "{i}huff... huff...{/i} How much further?"

1706
02:06:35,000 --> 02:06:41,000
Mirari:  "It isn't far now, [player_name]. Just hang in there a little while longer."

1707
02:06:41,000 --> 02:06:45,000
You:  "One who's already spent enough time outside today."

1708
02:06:45,000 --> 02:06:50,000
Fuyu:  "Hmph. If you have the energy to retort, you should be fine."

1709
02:06:50,000 --> 02:06:54,000
Mirari:  "Don't worry, it really is only a short walk from here."

1710
02:06:54,000 --> 02:06:57,000
Mirari:  "Any second now we'll be able to--"

1711
02:06:57,000 --> 02:06:59,000
Mirari:  "Ah! There it is!"

1712
02:06:59,000 --> 02:07:04,000
*Mirari jumps up and down on the spot while pointing towards the mountain.*

1713
02:07:04,000 --> 02:07:11,000
*I strain my eyes to see what she's so excited about, but all I can see is a hole in the side of the mountain.*

1714
02:07:11,000 --> 02:07:13,000
You:  "What is it? A cave?"

1715
02:07:13,000 --> 02:07:15,000
Fuyu:  "Not just any cave."

1716
02:07:15,000 --> 02:07:20,000
Mirari:  "Yes! It is what can be found {i}inside{/i} of the cave that matters."

1717
02:07:20,000 --> 02:07:22,000
You:  "Inside of the cave, huh?"

1718
02:07:22,000 --> 02:07:27,000
You:  "You'd better not be leading me into a bear's den or something."

1719
02:07:27,000 --> 02:07:31,000
Mirari:  "Of course not. Don't be silly, [player_name]."

1720
02:07:31,000 --> 02:07:36,000
Fuyu:  "Yeah. The bears are all hibernating this time of year anyway."

1721
02:07:36,000 --> 02:07:43,000
Fuyu:  "So even if we wanted to get rid of you, luring you into a bear's den would be a poor way to do it."

1722
02:07:43,000 --> 02:07:48,000
You:  "...It worries me that you seem to have given this some thought."

1723
02:07:48,000 --> 02:07:53,000
*Despite my apprehension, I follow the wolf-girls to the mouth of the cave.*

1724
02:07:53,000 --> 02:08:03,000
*After spending a short time walking through the cave, the temperature begins to rise to the point where I feel comfortable taking my coat off.*

1725
02:08:03,000 --> 02:08:10,000
*Finally, as we near the cave's innermost point, I understand what it is the girls wanted to show me.*

1726
02:08:10,000 --> 02:08:11,000
Fuyu:  "Fuaahhh..."

1727
02:08:11,000 --> 02:08:14,000
Mirari:  "Mmm... It feels {i}sooo{/i} good."

1728
02:08:14,000 --> 02:08:19,000
*In the depths of the cave, we find, of all things, a natural hot spring.*

1729
02:08:19,000 --> 02:08:29,000
*Doubting my own eyes, I stand in front of the hot spring, mouth agape, while the girls cast aside their clothing and jump in without hesitation.*

1730
02:08:29,000 --> 02:08:31,000
You:  "A hot spring... {i}here{/i}?"

1731
02:08:31,000 --> 02:08:35,000
You:  "How does that work? Is this a dormant volcano or something?"

1732
02:08:35,000 --> 02:08:38,000
Fuyu:  "Who cares? The water feels great!"

1733
02:08:38,000 --> 02:08:41,000
Mirari:  "Mmm... You can say that again."

1734
02:08:41,000 --> 02:08:44,000
Mirari:  "Come in and join us, [player_name]."

1735
02:08:44,000 --> 02:08:47,000
You:  "Uhh... No, I think I'll stay out here."

1736
02:08:47,000 --> 02:08:48,000
Mirari:  "Ehh~? Why?"

1737
02:08:48,000 --> 02:08:56,000
You:  "Well, I mean... The water is probably filled with bacteria, not to mention all sorts of sharp rocks on the base of it."

1738
02:08:56,000 --> 02:08:59,000
You:  "I think I'll be safer out here."

1739
02:08:59,000 --> 02:09:02,000
Mirari:  "Aww, come on. Don't be like that."

1740
02:09:02,000 --> 02:09:08,000
Mirari:  "We brought you here to thank you, [player_name]. We can't do that if you don't get in."

1741
02:09:08,000 --> 02:09:11,000
*(Oh, believe me. This is already thanks enough.)*

1742
02:09:11,000 --> 02:09:19,000
*I avert my gaze as I try to distract myself from the sublime figures of the two naked wolf-girls in front of me.*

1743
02:09:19,000 --> 02:09:22,000
*Seeing my reaction, Mirari pouts and swims closer.*

1744
02:09:22,000 --> 02:09:25,000
You:  "Wha-- Hey! What do you think you're doing?"

1745
02:09:25,000 --> 02:09:31,000
Mirari:  "Isn't it obvious? If you won't get in on your own, then I'll just have to pull you in."

1746
02:09:31,000 --> 02:09:39,000
You:  "If you pull me in right now, my clothes are going to get soaked, and I'll freeze to death on the way home!"

1747
02:09:39,000 --> 02:09:42,000
Mirari:  "Then take them off and jump in yourself."

1748
02:09:42,000 --> 02:09:47,000
*Fuyu snickers as Mirari shows a surprisingly forceful side of her personality.*

1749
02:09:47,000 --> 02:09:51,000
*It seems she doesn't like the idea of her kindness being refused.*

1750
02:09:51,000 --> 02:09:52,000
Mirari:  "...So?"

1751
02:09:52,000 --> 02:09:56,000
Fuyu:  "We're just bathing. Stop being such a prude."

1752
02:09:56,000 --> 02:10:00,000
You:  "So I'm the weird one here for having shame, am I?"

1753
02:10:00,000 --> 02:10:03,000
You:  "Whatever. Don't say I didn't warn you."

1754
02:10:03,000 --> 02:10:07,000
You:  "{i}haa...{/i} Wow, you girls weren't kidding."

1755
02:10:07,000 --> 02:10:08,000
Mirari:  "Right!?"

1756
02:10:08,000 --> 02:10:13,000
Mirari:  "I found this place the last time I ran away from the pack."

1757
02:10:13,000 --> 02:10:18,000
You:  "Haha. Nice to hear that something good came of your mischief."

1758
02:10:18,000 --> 02:10:22,000
Mirari:  "Something good {i}always{/i} comes of my mischief."

1759
02:10:22,000 --> 02:10:26,000
*Mirari smiles coyly as she brings one hand to her face.*

1760
02:10:26,000 --> 02:10:32,000
*Ever since she jumped into the hot spring, Mirari's been acting less reserved than usual.*

1761
02:10:32,000 --> 02:10:39,000
You:  "I guess a little bit of mischief is okay now and then, considering how well-behaved you usually are."

1762
02:10:39,000 --> 02:10:42,000
You:  "Though, speaking of mischief..."

1763
02:10:42,000 --> 02:10:44,000
*I turn around to look at Fuyu.*

1764
02:10:44,000 --> 02:10:45,000
Fuyu:  "Mmm..."

1765
02:10:45,000 --> 02:10:49,000
*Rather than join Mirari and I, Fuyu is sitting by herself.*

1766
02:10:49,000 --> 02:10:54,000
*She continues to squirm around, rubbing her thighs together with a red face.*

1767
02:10:54,000 --> 02:10:56,000
*(It... It couldn't be...)*

1768
02:10:56,000 --> 02:10:59,000
Mirari:  "Hmm~? What do you we have here?"

1769
02:10:59,000 --> 02:11:03,000
Mirari:  "What are you doing, hiding away over here?"

1770
02:11:03,000 --> 02:11:04,000
Fuyu:  "Fuah!?"

1771
02:11:04,000 --> 02:11:07,000
Fuyu:  "P-Princess!? What are you-- Ahhn!?"

1772
02:11:07,000 --> 02:11:12,000
*Seeing Fuyu sitting all by herself, Mirari decides it's time to intervene.*

1773
02:11:12,000 --> 02:11:16,000
Mirari:  "Heheh... You have to clean yourself properly, Fuyu."

1774
02:11:16,000 --> 02:11:24,000
Mirari:  "I know you usually just lick yourself clean, but it would be a shame to let this opportunity go to waste."

1775
02:11:24,000 --> 02:11:26,000
Fuyu:  "N-No... Princess, don't...!"

1776
02:11:26,000 --> 02:11:31,000
Mirari:  "Heheh... Your breasts have grown again, haven't they, Fuyu?"

1777
02:11:31,000 --> 02:11:38,000
Mirari:  "And your skin is so smooth. I'm surprised it's still so gorgeous, considering how rarely you bathe."

1778
02:11:38,000 --> 02:11:42,000
Fuyu:  "P-Princess, please stop this! What has gotten into you!?"

1779
02:11:42,000 --> 02:11:45,000
Fuyu:  "Is this water messing with your brain!?"

1780
02:11:45,000 --> 02:11:51,000
Mirari:  "Aww, don't be like that. I'm not the only one acting different... right?"

1781
02:11:51,000 --> 02:11:56,000
Fuyu:  "No... I-I can wash myself... Please, Princess, just-- Hyah!?"

1782
02:11:56,000 --> 02:12:03,000
*No matter how hard I try to suppress my dirty thoughts, Mirari seems intent on making that impossible.*

1783
02:12:03,000 --> 02:12:07,000
Fuyu:  "Princess, don't... That place shouldn't be..."

1784
02:12:07,000 --> 02:12:08,000
Fuyu:  "{i}*gasp*{/i}"

1785
02:12:08,000 --> 02:12:14,000
*Fuyu freezes up as she looks at my face, as though she's only just remembered that I'm present.*

1786
02:12:14,000 --> 02:12:16,000
Mirari:  "Oho~ What's this?"

1787
02:12:16,000 --> 02:12:23,000
Mirari:  "I only just cleaned you off, but the moment you looked at [player_name], you got all dirty again."

1788
02:12:23,000 --> 02:12:26,000
Fuyu:  "Wha...!? N-No! Of course not!"

1789
02:12:26,000 --> 02:12:28,000
Fuyu:  "How could that be possible!?"

1790
02:12:28,000 --> 02:12:31,000
*Fuyu protests fiercely as she turns away from me.*

1791
02:12:31,000 --> 02:12:39,000
*Not even a second later, however, I catch her glancing at me out of the corner of her eye, still red in the face.*

1792
02:12:39,000 --> 02:12:43,000
Mirari:  "{i}haa...{/i} You're such a poor liar, Fuyu."

1793
02:12:43,000 --> 02:12:47,000
Mirari:  "At least your body is honest about what it wants."

1794
02:12:47,000 --> 02:12:51,000
You:  "H-Hey, Mirari. Don't you think you're going a bit far?"

1795
02:12:51,000 --> 02:12:56,000
You:  "You shouldn't be so rough with Fuyu. She's a girl too, you know."

1796
02:12:56,000 --> 02:12:57,000
Fuyu:  "~~~~!?"

1797
02:12:57,000 --> 02:13:02,000
*Before she can disappear from my sight, I quickly follow after Fuyu.*

1798
02:13:02,000 --> 02:13:11,000
*Departing from the same door through which I've just entered, Fuyu runs out into the snow, seemingly without any purpose or direction.*

1799
02:13:11,000 --> 02:13:18,000
*She simply runs straight ahead, intent on creating as much distance between herself and Mirari as she can.*

1800
02:13:18,000 --> 02:13:22,000
You:  "{i}huff... huff...{/i} S-Slow down, would you?"

1801
02:13:22,000 --> 02:13:25,000
You:  "I'm not as athletic as you are."

1802
02:13:25,000 --> 02:13:28,000
Fuyu:  "[player_name]!? What are you--"

1803
02:13:28,000 --> 02:13:30,000
Fuyu:  "...Oh. I get it."

1804
02:13:30,000 --> 02:13:37,000
Fuyu:  "The princess couldn't bring herself to face me, so she sent you to do her bidding. Is that it?"

1805
02:13:37,000 --> 02:13:42,000
*Fuyu, initially surprised to see me, quickly adopts an expression of annoyance.*

1806
02:13:42,000 --> 02:13:52,000
*Her bid for solitude has failed, and rather than be greeted by the face of her best friend, the one who chases after her is her least favorite human.*

1807
02:13:52,000 --> 02:13:54,000
You:  "Nobody sent me anywhere."

1808
02:13:54,000 --> 02:14:01,000
You:  "I just saw you running away from the cabin in tears, so I thought I'd better check up on you."

1809
02:14:01,000 --> 02:14:03,000
Fuyu:  "I-I wasn't in tears!"

1810
02:14:03,000 --> 02:14:07,000
Fuyu:  "And if I was, they were righteous tears of anger!"

1811
02:14:07,000 --> 02:14:09,000
You:  "Righteous anger, huh?"

1812
02:14:09,000 --> 02:14:14,000
You:  "What happened? Did Mirari refuse to give you seconds for breakfast?"

1813
02:14:14,000 --> 02:14:23,000
*I play dumb and intentionally provoke Fuyu, thinking that this way she'll be more likely to slip up and accidentally tell me the truth.*

1814
02:14:23,000 --> 02:14:24,000
*Unfortunately--*

1815
02:14:24,000 --> 02:14:26,000
Fuyu:  "It's none of your business."

1816
02:14:26,000 --> 02:14:28,000
Fuyu:  "Get lost, human."

1817
02:14:28,000 --> 02:14:31,000
*...My plan fails almost immediately.*

1818
02:14:31,000 --> 02:14:34,000
You:  "Come on, Fuyu. Don't be like that."

1819
02:14:34,000 --> 02:14:39,000
You:  "Besides, even if you don't tell me, you know that Mirari will."

1820
02:14:39,000 --> 02:14:43,000
You:  "Wouldn't you rather have me hear your side of the story?"

1821
02:14:43,000 --> 02:14:46,000
Fuyu:  "Hmph. Why should I care what you hear?"

1822
02:14:46,000 --> 02:14:49,000
Fuyu:  "...It's not like you'd take my side anyway."

1823
02:14:49,000 --> 02:14:51,000
You:  "You don't know that."

1824
02:14:51,000 --> 02:14:53,000
You:  "Try me. I might surprise you."

1825
02:14:53,000 --> 02:14:54,000
Fuyu:  "......"

1826
02:14:54,000 --> 02:14:57,000
*Fuyu turns away, but doesn't actually refuse.*

1827
02:14:57,000 --> 02:15:04,000
*After thinking over my words for a moment, she lets out a sigh, then turns to face me once more.*

1828
02:15:04,000 --> 02:15:06,000
Fuyu:  "...Fine. I'll enlighten you."

1829
02:15:06,000 --> 02:15:15,000
Fuyu:  "This may be difficult for a human to understand, but within the pack, everyone has their own role and responsibilities."

1830
02:15:15,000 --> 02:15:20,000
Fuyu:  "For some of us, that's gathering food. For others, it's building shelter."

1831
02:15:20,000 --> 02:15:23,000
Fuyu:  "In Mirari's case, it's her duty to lead us."

1832
02:15:23,000 --> 02:15:32,000
Fuyu:  "She must protect us from harm, make difficult decisions about our future, and ensure that everyone does their part to help out."

1833
02:15:32,000 --> 02:15:38,000
Fuyu:  "Most importantly, it's up to our leader to solve any disputes which arise."

1834
02:15:38,000 --> 02:15:45,000
Fuyu:  "They must put an end to any bickering, and quell unrest within the pack before it becomes a problem."

1835
02:15:45,000 --> 02:15:48,000
Fuyu:  "Are you with me so far, [player_name]?"

1836
02:15:48,000 --> 02:15:51,000
You:  "Yes, I understand what you're saying."

1837
02:15:51,000 --> 02:15:57,000
You:  "Make decisions, keep everyone in their place, stop any infighting. Typical leadership."

1838
02:15:57,000 --> 02:16:01,000
Fuyu:  "Good. I'm glad this isn't too difficult for you."

1839
02:16:01,000 --> 02:16:09,000
Fuyu:  "Now, given the responsibilities of a leader, what do you think would happen if our leader suddenly abandoned us?"

1840
02:16:09,000 --> 02:16:12,000
You:  "...A new leader would be chosen?"

1841
02:16:12,000 --> 02:16:16,000
Fuyu:  "A new leader would {i}take the position by force{/i}."

1842
02:16:16,000 --> 02:16:27,000
Fuyu:  "Democracy has never worked for my kind. At the end of the day, whoever is strongest will attempt to seize control, with or without the support of the pack."

1843
02:16:27,000 --> 02:16:35,000
Fuyu:  "In the best case scenario, they take over without a fight, and everybody accepts their new leader right away."

1844
02:16:35,000 --> 02:16:42,000
Fuyu:  "If they don't, or if more than one person puts their hand up, then... there's a power struggle."

1845
02:16:42,000 --> 02:16:51,000
Fuyu:  "The wannabe leaders kill one another. Or, if they don't want to fight, they take their own followers and form their own pack."

1846
02:16:51,000 --> 02:17:01,000
Fuyu:  "Either way, the pack loses its power. It's reduced in size, possibly fragmented, and everyone needs to cover multiple roles to fill in the gaps."

1847
02:17:01,000 --> 02:17:09,000
Fuyu:  "But don't think that's the end of the matter, [player_name]. What I've just described is simply the beginning."

1848
02:17:09,000 --> 02:17:14,000
*I unconsciously gulp as I try to take in everything that Fuyu has just told me.*

1849
02:17:14,000 --> 02:17:21,000
*Honestly, I'm surprised. Mirari's desertion is beginning to sound far more serious than I thought.*

1850
02:17:21,000 --> 02:17:26,000
*I can now see why Fuyu is so serious about bringing Mirari back home with her.*

1851
02:17:26,000 --> 02:17:29,000
You:  "Wow. That's quite a lot to process."

1852
02:17:29,000 --> 02:17:34,000
You:  "I never thought Mirari's disappearance would have such a profound impact."

1853
02:17:34,000 --> 02:17:36,000
Fuyu:  "Well, now you understand."

1854
02:17:36,000 --> 02:17:40,000
Fuyu:  "...Do you really think Mirari would be okay like this?"

1855
02:17:40,000 --> 02:17:41,000
You:  "Huh?"

1856
02:17:41,000 --> 02:17:43,000
You:  "What do you mean? Like what?"

1857
02:17:43,000 --> 02:17:47,000
Fuyu:  "You know... Out here, all alone, living like you do."

1858
02:17:47,000 --> 02:17:54,000
Fuyu:  "The princess may say she wants to separate from the pack, but do you think she's really capable of it?"

1859
02:17:54,000 --> 02:18:00,000
You:  "Ah... So you're talking about Mirari's well-being now, rather than that of the pack."

1860
02:18:00,000 --> 02:18:06,000
You:  "No, I can't say that I think Mirari would be suited to the life of a loner."

1861
02:18:06,000 --> 02:18:14,000
You:  "It takes a great deal of strength, both physical and mental, to live on your own far removed from society."

1862
02:18:14,000 --> 02:18:20,000
You:  "I may not know Mirari as well as you do, but personally, I don't think she'd cope."

1863
02:18:20,000 --> 02:18:23,000
Fuyu:  "...Indeed. I believe we are in agreement."

1864
02:18:23,000 --> 02:18:30,000
Fuyu:  "The princess's strength lies in how she interacts with others. On her own, she is quite hopeless."

1865
02:18:30,000 --> 02:18:33,000
You:  "Haha, I kind of figured that was the case."

1866
02:18:33,000 --> 02:18:36,000
You:  "Living in solitude isn't for everyone."

1867
02:18:36,000 --> 02:18:43,000
Fuyu:  "I agree. The princess ought to live her life in safety and comfort, surrounded by others."

1868
02:18:43,000 --> 02:18:48,000
Fuyu:  "...No, not just the princess. I believe that applies to all people."

1869
02:18:48,000 --> 02:18:51,000
You:  "Everyone? That's a bit of a stretch."

1870
02:18:51,000 --> 02:18:56,000
You:  "I'm actually pretty happy to be out here by myself, you know."

1871
02:18:56,000 --> 02:18:58,000
Fuyu:  "Are you really?"

1872
02:18:58,000 --> 02:19:01,000
*Fuyu narrows her gaze as she scrutinizes my face.*

1873
02:19:01,000 --> 02:19:08,000
Fuyu:  "You say that you're happy out here, but wouldn't you rather be with your friends and family?"

1874
02:19:08,000 --> 02:19:15,000
Fuyu:  "Wouldn't you prefer to make a difference in the lives of others, and to share in their experiences?"

1875
02:19:15,000 --> 02:19:17,000
You:  "Well... maybe sometimes."

1876
02:19:17,000 --> 02:19:21,000
You:  "But aren't I already doing what you just suggested?"

1877
02:19:21,000 --> 02:19:22,000
Fuyu:  "...Huh?"

1878
02:19:22,000 --> 02:19:28,000
*A smile surfaces on my face as I take the opportunity to share my perspective with Fuyu.*

1879
02:19:28,000 --> 02:19:38,000
You:  "You just implied that I should be living with my family, because that way I would make a difference in the lives of people other than myself."

1880
02:19:38,000 --> 02:19:42,000
You:  "But isn't that exactly what I've been doing out here?"

1881
02:19:42,000 --> 02:19:48,000
You:  "I don't mean to brag, but a few days ago, I saved a life. {i}Mirari's{/i} life."

1882
02:19:48,000 --> 02:19:55,000
You:  "If I hadn't been living out here, far away from civilization, that girl would have perished in the snow."

1883
02:19:55,000 --> 02:19:56,000
*Fuyu goes quiet.*

1884
02:19:56,000 --> 02:20:04,000
*Even if she doesn't agree with my lifestyle, there's no way she can complain about me saving her friend's life.*

1885
02:20:04,000 --> 02:20:12,000
You:  "Anyway, even if I never met Mirari, I don't think there's any shame in choosing to live for and by yourself."

1886
02:20:12,000 --> 02:20:19,000
You:  "I came out here because I wanted to get away from everyone, and that's exactly what I've done."

1887
02:20:19,000 --> 02:20:29,000
You:  "So while I personally don't think my lifestyle would work for Mirari, I'm not about to tell her what she can and can't do with her life."

1888
02:20:29,000 --> 02:20:35,000
You:  "Maybe she'll miss everyone and come back, maybe she'll enjoy living in solitude."

1889
02:20:35,000 --> 02:20:43,000
You:  "Either way, I think it's Mirari's decision, and whatever she decides, you're just going to have to live with it."

1890
02:20:43,000 --> 02:20:44,000
Fuyu:  "......"

1891
02:20:44,000 --> 02:20:48,000
Fuyu:  "I think... we're going to have to agree to disagree."

1892
02:20:48,000 --> 02:20:57,000
Fuyu:  "I can see your point, and you've given me a lot to think about, but... at this moment, I still cannot accept Mirari's selfishness."

1893
02:20:57,000 --> 02:21:03,000
You:  "That's fine. If you'll agree to try and see things her way, then I think that's plenty."

1894
02:21:03,000 --> 02:21:07,000
*(And, knowing Mirari, it's probably all she's ever hoped for.)*

1895
02:21:07,000 --> 02:21:10,000
You:  "{i}sigh...{/i} Fuyu, what are you doing?"

1896
02:21:10,000 --> 02:21:11,000
Fuyu:  "......"

1897
02:21:11,000 --> 02:21:13,000
You:  "Is something wrong?"

1898
02:21:13,000 --> 02:21:18,000
You:  "If you're hungry again, go ask Mirari to make you something."

1899
02:21:18,000 --> 02:21:21,000
*Without saying a word, Fuyu draws closer.*

1900
02:21:21,000 --> 02:21:25,000
*She tiptoes over to my bed, careful not to make too much noise.*

1901
02:21:25,000 --> 02:21:27,000
*Once Fuyu has reached near my bed--*

1902
02:21:27,000 --> 02:21:29,000
*She begins to undress.*

1903
02:21:29,000 --> 02:21:31,000
You:  "F-Fuyu!? What are you doing?"

1904
02:21:31,000 --> 02:21:33,000
You:  "Are you still half-asleep?"

1905
02:21:33,000 --> 02:21:37,000
*Paying my words no mind, Fuyu removes the rest of her clothes.*

1906
02:21:37,000 --> 02:21:43,000
*She then crawls towards me on her hands and knees, not stopping until she reaches my side.*

1907
02:21:43,000 --> 02:21:45,000
Fuyu:  "[player_name]..."

1908
02:21:45,000 --> 02:21:48,000
*An inch away from my face, Fuyu calls my name.*

1909
02:21:48,000 --> 02:21:55,000
*Her cheeks are red, her eyes are watery, and I can tell at a glance that she isn't her usual self.*

1910
02:21:55,000 --> 02:21:57,000
Fuyu:  "[player_name]... Please..."

1911
02:21:57,000 --> 02:22:00,000
*While facing me, Fuyu opens her legs.*

1912
02:22:00,000 --> 02:22:07,000
*Now that she's almost naked, and on her knees right in front of me, I can see every inch of her body.*

1913
02:22:07,000 --> 02:22:12,000
*Despite her embarrassment, Fuyu makes no effort to hide her body from my eyes.*

1914
02:22:12,000 --> 02:22:15,000
Fuyu:  "It's your fault that I'm like this."

1915
02:22:15,000 --> 02:22:21,000
Fuyu:  "I never once felt this way around Mirari, or the other members of our pack."

1916
02:22:21,000 --> 02:22:23,000
Fuyu:  "So... take responsibility."

1917
02:22:23,000 --> 02:22:27,000
*As I dared to think earlier, this wolf-girl is in heat.*

1918
02:22:27,000 --> 02:22:34,000
You:  "Listen, Fuyu... I'm flattered that you'd think of me that way, but you don't really want to do this."

1919
02:22:34,000 --> 02:22:39,000
You:  "What you're feeling right now is just an influx in your hormones."

1920
02:22:39,000 --> 02:22:45,000
You:  "If you go through with this, you're surely going to regret it, and... uh..."

1921
02:22:45,000 --> 02:22:47,000
Fuyu:  "...Are you done?"

1922
02:22:47,000 --> 02:22:50,000
*Fuyu pushes her face right next to mine.*

1923
02:22:50,000 --> 02:22:56,000
*With her lips an inch away from mine, she looks into my eyes longingly and continues to speak.*

1924
02:22:56,000 --> 02:23:00,000
Fuyu:  "I don't expect you to feel the same way I do."

1925
02:23:00,000 --> 02:23:06,000
Fuyu:  "In fact, after all of the things I've said and done to you, you probably despise me."

1926
02:23:06,000 --> 02:23:09,000
Fuyu:  "Even so, I can't help the way I feel."

1927
02:23:09,000 --> 02:23:14,000
Fuyu:  "Whether you love me or hate me, please, I beg of you... embrace me."

1928
02:23:14,000 --> 02:23:18,000
*Before I can respond, Fuyu closes the final distance between us.*

1929
02:23:18,000 --> 02:23:25,000
*Her soft, pursed lips brush up against mine, kissing me so lightly that I can just barely feel it.*

1930
02:23:25,000 --> 02:23:31,000
*The moment she begins to pull back, Fuyu closes in once more, this time with confidence.*

1931
02:23:31,000 --> 02:23:38,000
*She pushes her lips against mine forcefully, taking me by surprise and stealing the air from my lungs.*

1932
02:23:38,000 --> 02:23:44,000
*Fuyu then moves back slightly and lowers her head, bringing her lips to my neck instead.*

1933
02:23:44,000 --> 02:23:52,000
*She runs her tongue along my neck for a moment before doing the same thing with her nose, nuzzling me expectantly.*

1934
02:23:52,000 --> 02:23:54,000
Fuyu:  "A-Am I doing this right?"

1935
02:23:54,000 --> 02:23:58,000
Fuyu:  "You'll tell me if I do something wrong... won't you?"

1936
02:23:58,000 --> 02:24:02,000
*Fuyu raises her hips off the bed as her body begins to convulse.*

1937
02:24:02,000 --> 02:24:07,000
*Both sets of lips quiver, and her breathing quickens further than before.*

1938
02:24:07,000 --> 02:24:11,000
Fuyu:  "[player_name]... [player_name], I-I can't...!"

1939
02:24:11,000 --> 02:24:14,000
Fuyu:  "My... My body is... My body issss...!!"

1940
02:24:14,000 --> 02:24:16,000
Fuyu:  "Hnnnghh... Hngaaaahhh!!"

1941
02:24:16,000 --> 02:24:20,000
*Once Fuyu has left the cabin, I make my presence known.*

1942
02:24:20,000 --> 02:24:29,000
*I walk straight over to Mirari and kneel down in front of her, bringing my face to her level as she sits on the couch and quietly sobs.*

1943
02:24:29,000 --> 02:24:33,000
Mirari:  "[player_name], you... H-How long were you..."

1944
02:24:33,000 --> 02:24:34,000
You:  "Long enough."

1945
02:24:34,000 --> 02:24:37,000
You:  "Sorry, I didn't mean to eavesdrop."

1946
02:24:37,000 --> 02:24:41,000
Mirari:  "No... It is nothing you need to apologize for."

1947
02:24:41,000 --> 02:24:48,000
Mirari:  "This is your home. You have a right to hear any conversations which take place within these walls."

1948
02:24:48,000 --> 02:24:54,000
*Mirari straightens her back and looks at me as she talks, but soon begins to slouch forward.*

1949
02:24:54,000 --> 02:25:01,000
*Even if my presence is a welcome distraction, it isn't enough to make her forget about her worries.*

1950
02:25:01,000 --> 02:25:04,000
You:  "So... that fight you and Fuyu just had--"

1951
02:25:04,000 --> 02:25:06,000
Mirari:  "It was not a fight."

1952
02:25:06,000 --> 02:25:09,000
*Mirari speaks forcefully as she shakes her head.*

1953
02:25:09,000 --> 02:25:13,000
Mirari:  "We were simply reaffirming one another's positions."

1954
02:25:13,000 --> 02:25:16,000
Mirari:  "That conversation was long overdue."

1955
02:25:16,000 --> 02:25:17,000
You:  "I... I see..."

1956
02:25:17,000 --> 02:25:21,000
You:  "Do your conversations normally end with Fuyu hitting you?"

1957
02:25:21,000 --> 02:25:27,000
*Mirari immediately opens her mouth to deny my claim, but instead finds herself without words.*

1958
02:25:27,000 --> 02:25:33,000
*Whether she cares to admit it or not, Mirari's conversation with Fuyu didn't end well.*

1959
02:25:33,000 --> 02:25:35,000
Mirari:  "...So you saw that."

1960
02:25:35,000 --> 02:25:38,000
You:  "I could have heard it from outside."

1961
02:25:38,000 --> 02:25:47,000
You:  "Why didn't you defend yourself? Having a difference of opinion is one thing, but getting physical is a bit much, even for Fuyu."

1962
02:25:47,000 --> 02:25:49,000
Mirari:  "No... You're wrong."

1963
02:25:49,000 --> 02:25:58,000
Mirari:  "Even if Fuyu had left lacerations all across my face, it still wouldn't be anywhere near enough to punish me for what I've done."

1964
02:25:58,000 --> 02:26:01,000
You:  "You mean... for running away from home?"

1965
02:26:01,000 --> 02:26:11,000
You:  "If so, then I still think this is all rather extreme. Even if Fuyu's mad about you leaving her behind, that's no reason to get physical."

1966
02:26:11,000 --> 02:26:20,000
You:  "Besides, you shouldn't have to go along with what everyone else expects you to do just because you don't want to let them down."

1967
02:26:20,000 --> 02:26:29,000
You:  "Nobody gets to tell you how to live. You have to make your own life decisions, even if other people don't agree with them."

1968
02:26:29,000 --> 02:26:32,000
*(And boy, will they disagree with you.)*

