*({i}haa...{/i} So much for having a serious discussion.)*

2156
02:42:36,000 --> 02:42:42,000
*(I guess I'll just have to wait until Fuyu has calmed down before I try talking to her.)*

2157
02:42:42,000 --> 02:42:45,000
*Giving up for the day, I return to my bedroom.*

2158
02:42:45,000 --> 02:42:50,000
*As I go to walk through the door, however, I find someone standing in the way.*

2159
02:42:50,000 --> 02:42:51,000
You:  "...Fuyu?"

2160
02:42:51,000 --> 02:42:52,000
Fuyu:  "Hiyah!!?"

2161
02:42:52,000 --> 02:42:55,000
*Fuyu jumps in fright as I call her name.*

2162
02:42:55,000 --> 02:42:58,000
You:  "Fuyu, what are you doing out here?"

2163
02:42:58,000 --> 02:43:02,000
You:  "Is there something you'd like to talk to me about?"

2164
02:43:02,000 --> 02:43:03,000
Fuyu:  "......"

2165
02:43:03,000 --> 02:43:09,000
*Fuyu says nothing as she stares at me, but it seems like she wants to say something.*

2166
02:43:09,000 --> 02:43:12,000
*(Perhaps a bit more privacy is a good idea.)*

2167
02:43:12,000 --> 02:43:15,000
You:  "Would you like to go for a walk?"

2168
02:43:15,000 --> 02:43:16,000
Fuyu:  "Wha--"

2169
02:43:16,000 --> 02:43:20,000
*Fuyu opens her eyes and mouth wide as she stares at me in shock.*

2170
02:43:20,000 --> 02:43:22,000
*The next moment, however--*

2171
02:43:22,000 --> 02:43:23,000
Fuyu:  "...Mmm."

2172
02:43:23,000 --> 02:43:25,000
Fuyu:  "Yes... Yes, I would."

2173
02:43:25,000 --> 02:43:28,000
*To my surprise, Fuyu agrees to the walk.*

2174
02:43:28,000 --> 02:43:33,000
*She brushes past me and out the door, and quickly descends down the stairs.*

2175
02:43:33,000 --> 02:43:34,000
*Better follow her.*

2176
02:43:34,000 --> 02:43:39,000
*The air outside is crisp, but not to the point of being unpleasant.*

2177
02:43:39,000 --> 02:43:45,000
*(I figure I'm better off trying to talk to Fuyu out here. The outdoors seem to calm her.)*

2178
02:43:45,000 --> 02:43:49,000
*Beet red, yet smiling faintly, Fuyu walks in front of me.*

2179
02:43:49,000 --> 02:43:57,000
*Without looking back at me even once, she sits on the edge of a stump, fidgeting restlessly as she looks down at her fingers.*

2180
02:43:57,000 --> 02:44:02,000
*I follow Fuyu over to the fallen tree, then take a seat right next to her.*

2181
02:44:02,000 --> 02:44:04,000
Fuyu:  "Uhm... [player_name]..."

2182
02:44:04,000 --> 02:44:06,000
Fuyu:  "About the other night..."

2183
02:44:06,000 --> 02:44:07,000
You:  "Yes, Fuyu?"

2184
02:44:07,000 --> 02:44:08,000
Fuyu:  "......"

2185
02:44:08,000 --> 02:44:11,000
Fuyu:  "I... Wh-What happened that night..."

2186
02:44:11,000 --> 02:44:14,000
Fuyu:  "It was all, uhm... you know..."

2187
02:44:14,000 --> 02:44:19,000
Fuyu:  "I only acted that was because of... my biology... and, uhm..."

2188
02:44:19,000 --> 02:44:23,000
Fuyu:  "You know... Instinct made me do it... or something..."

2189
02:44:23,000 --> 02:44:26,000
Fuyu:  "So... d-don't go misunderstanding, okay?"

2190
02:44:26,000 --> 02:44:32,000
Fuyu:  "I-It's not as though I like you, or want to be your... m-mate or anything..."

2191
02:44:32,000 --> 02:44:38,000
*Stammering uncontrollably, Fuyu eventually manages to squeeze out a few sentences.*

2192
02:44:38,000 --> 02:44:46,000
*Still looking down at her lap, she plays with her fingers as she speaks, desperate to avoid eye contact at all costs.*

2193
02:44:46,000 --> 02:44:49,000
*(Ah. So it was just a hormonal thing after all.)*

2194
02:44:49,000 --> 02:44:50,000
Fuyu:  "......"

2195
02:44:50,000 --> 02:44:53,000
Fuyu:  "You don't understand anything at all."

2196
02:44:53,000 --> 02:44:54,000
You:  "...Huh?"

2197
02:44:54,000 --> 02:44:57,000
Fuyu:  "I said you {i}don't{/i} understand!"

2198
02:44:57,000 --> 02:45:03,000
Fuyu:  "I'm not just some slave to my body, you know! I have my own thoughts and free will!"

2199
02:45:03,000 --> 02:45:08,000
Fuyu:  "I wouldn't do that with someone just because my body told me to, okay!?"

2200
02:45:08,000 --> 02:45:10,000
You:  "N... No, I get that, but..."

2201
02:45:10,000 --> 02:45:12,000
You:  "Didn't you just say--"

2202
02:45:12,000 --> 02:45:15,000
Fuyu:  "Ahh, geez! Forget I said anything!"

2203
02:45:15,000 --> 02:45:18,000
Fuyu:  "This is why I can't stand you humans!"

2204
02:45:18,000 --> 02:45:22,000
*Jumping to her feet in a huff, Fuyu begins to leave the area.*

2205
02:45:22,000 --> 02:45:27,000
*Confused, and also somewhat worried about her, I stand up and follow after her.*

2206
02:45:27,000 --> 02:45:32,000
You:  "Fuyu, I get that you're feeling temperamental at the moment, but--"

2207
02:45:32,000 --> 02:45:36,000
Fuyu:  "Shut up! You don't know a damn thing about how I feel!"

2208
02:45:36,000 --> 02:45:41,000
Fuyu:  "How could a human ever understand what my kind goes through!?"

2209
02:45:41,000 --> 02:45:44,000
*Fuyu snaps at me the moment I catch up to her.*

2210
02:45:44,000 --> 02:45:50,000
*Backing away defensively, Fuyu acts like cornered prey as she creates distance between us.*

2211
02:45:50,000 --> 02:45:54,000
Fuyu:  "No... It's not just you. Even the princess doesn't get it."

2212
02:45:54,000 --> 02:46:00,000
Fuyu:  "None of you understand my feelings at all. None of you even {i}try{/i} to understand!"

2213
02:46:00,000 --> 02:46:07,000
Fuyu:  "Why is Mirari the only one who gets to be selfish!? Why can't I take something for myself for once!?"

2214
02:46:07,000 --> 02:46:12,000
Fuyu:  "Even here, away from the pack, I still can't have things my way!"

2215
02:46:12,000 --> 02:46:20,000
*Before I realize it, Fuyu's squabble with me has turned into an excuse for her to complain about her lot in life.*

2216
02:46:20,000 --> 02:46:26,000
*Out in a forest with nobody but a single human being, Fuyu begins to vent her frustration.*

2217
02:46:26,000 --> 02:46:29,000
Fuyu:  "Why...? Why is it always her...?"

2218
02:46:29,000 --> 02:46:34,000
Fuyu:  "Why is it that, no matter what I do, I'm always living in her shadow?"

2219
02:46:34,000 --> 02:46:40,000
Fuyu:  "Even now, when it's just the three of us, I'm still... nothing compared to her."

2220
02:46:40,000 --> 02:46:43,000
You:  "Fuyu, what are you talking about?"

2221
02:46:43,000 --> 02:46:50,000
You:  "I don't know what life was like with your pack, but in my cabin, the two of you are equal."

2222
02:46:50,000 --> 02:46:53,000
Fuyu:  "Don't lie to me, [player_name]!"

2223
02:46:53,000 --> 02:47:00,000
Fuyu:  "The princess got here first... she made herself useful, enamored herself with human culture..."

2224
02:47:00,000 --> 02:47:03,000
Fuyu:  "...She even managed to steal your heart."

2225
02:47:03,000 --> 02:47:09,000
Fuyu:  "Before I could so much as stake my claim, that girl took everything for herself!"

2226
02:47:09,000 --> 02:47:11,000
You:  "My... My heart?"

2227
02:47:11,000 --> 02:47:14,000
You:  "What are you trying to say, Fuyu?"

2228
02:47:14,000 --> 02:47:17,000
Fuyu:  "...You don't need to hide it."

2229
02:47:17,000 --> 02:47:21,000
Fuyu:  "I can see the way that you two look at each other."

2230
02:47:21,000 --> 02:47:26,000
Fuyu:  "She's the reason why you don't want to be with me, isn't she!?"

2231
02:47:26,000 --> 02:47:27,000
You:  "What!?"

2232
02:47:27,000 --> 02:47:31,000
You:  "Fuyu, Mirari and I don't have that kind of relationship!"

2233
02:47:31,000 --> 02:47:33,000
Fuyu:  "Like I believe that!"

2234
02:47:33,000 --> 02:47:40,000
Fuyu:  "You two have probably been doing lewd things this entire time behind my back, haven't you!?"

2235
02:47:40,000 --> 02:47:41,000
You:  "W-We have not!"

2236
02:47:41,000 --> 02:47:45,000
You:  "Mirari's a nice girl, and I do like her, but--"

2237
02:47:45,000 --> 02:47:46,000
Fuyu:  "But what!?"

2238
02:47:46,000 --> 02:47:52,000
You:  "...But you're the only one with whom I've ever done something like that, Fuyu."

2239
02:47:52,000 --> 02:47:53,000
Fuyu:  "......"

2240
02:47:53,000 --> 02:47:54,000
Fuyu:  "Eh?"

2241
02:47:54,000 --> 02:47:58,000
*Fuyu's anger dissipates in an instant, replaced by confusion.*

2242
02:47:58,000 --> 02:48:05,000
*Before she can regain her senses and deny my words, I take a seat on a log, prompting Fuyu to do the same.*

2243
02:48:05,000 --> 02:48:10,000
*She hesitates for a moment, then sits next to me, crossing her arms indignantly.*

2244
02:48:10,000 --> 02:48:17,000
You:  "Fuyu, I'm sorry about what I said before, but I didn't do it for the reason you're thinking."

2245
02:48:17,000 --> 02:48:22,000
You:  "Humans... {i}sigh...{/i} Humans aren't like half-wolves in that way."

2246
02:48:22,000 --> 02:48:27,000
You:  "We don't mate for life, or want to have kids with people we barely know."

2247
02:48:27,000 --> 02:48:36,000
You:  "Humans tend to spend years with one another before talking about that kind of stuff. And even then, it rarely works out."

2248
02:48:36,000 --> 02:48:45,000
You:  "That's why... I don't want to enter into that kind of relationship on a whim, or as a consequence of you going into heat."

2249
02:48:45,000 --> 02:48:49,000
*Taken in by my words, Fuyu sits quietly next to me.*

2250
02:48:49,000 --> 02:48:54,000
*I place my hand on Fuyu's head and speak to her in a soft tone of voice.*

2251
02:48:54,000 --> 02:49:02,000
You:  "Fuyu, I've been alone for a long, {i}long{/i} time. And, just like you, I have no idea how to act around others."

2252
02:49:02,000 --> 02:49:13,000
You:  "I closed off my heart, started pushing people away, and abandoned everyone and everything I ever cared about, all to start a new life out here on my own."

2253
02:49:13,000 --> 02:49:22,000
You:  "But you know... in the short time you and Mirari have been here, you've shown me how impossible my goal was from the very beginning."

2254
02:49:22,000 --> 02:49:31,000
You:  "I was wrong to think that I was better off alone. The time I've spent with the two of you have been the most fun I've had in years."

2255
02:49:31,000 --> 02:49:42,000
You:  "And I think, if you opened your heart, if you allowed someone else to see your true self for once instead of getting defensive... you might feel the same way."

2256
02:49:42,000 --> 02:49:48,000
*I mess up Fuyu's hair slightly with my hand, then remove my hand from her head and lean back.*

2257
02:49:48,000 --> 02:49:58,000
You:  "Even so, I know how hard it is to change. I also know what a big decision this is, and how great of an effect it will have on your life."

2258
02:49:58,000 --> 02:50:05,000
You:  "If you're serious about wanting a relationship with me, Fuyu, then you'll need to be patient."

2259
02:50:05,000 --> 02:50:13,000
You:  "I need my partner to be someone who takes these matters as seriously as I do, and won't give up everything on a whim."

2260
02:50:13,000 --> 02:50:17,000
You:  "I need someone... who shares the same ideals I do."

2261
02:50:17,000 --> 02:50:20,000
*Fuyu remains silent as she listens to my words.*

2262
02:50:20,000 --> 02:50:30,000
*Other than expressing minor displeasure at having her hair ruffled, Fuyu remains attentive, barely changing her expression or breaking her concentration.*

2263
02:50:30,000 --> 02:50:38,000
*When I've finished speaking, Fuyu looks away with a serious expression on her face, still clinging to a modicum of defiance.*

2264
02:50:38,000 --> 02:50:40,000
Fuyu:  "I-Insolent human..."

2265
02:50:40,000 --> 02:50:45,000
Fuyu:  "I already told you, I don't want anything like that from you."

2266
02:50:45,000 --> 02:50:47,000
You:  "But you do, don't you?"

2267
02:50:47,000 --> 02:50:48,000
Fuyu:  "......"

2268
02:50:48,000 --> 02:50:51,000
Fuyu:  "I'm not talking to you anymore."

2269
02:50:51,000 --> 02:50:54,000
*Fuyu pouts and continues to avoid eye contact.*

2270
02:50:54,000 --> 02:51:01,000
*I take that as Fuyu signaling that she needs some alone time to think about everything I've just told her.*

2271
02:51:01,000 --> 02:51:03,000
You:  "Alright. I understand."

2272
02:51:03,000 --> 02:51:06,000
You:  "I'm going to head back inside now."

2273
02:51:06,000 --> 02:51:09,000
You:  "I'll talk to you tomorrow, Fuyu."

2274
02:51:09,000 --> 02:51:10,000
Fuyu:  "Wait!"

2275
02:51:10,000 --> 02:51:11,000
Fuyu:  "Ah... Uhm..."

2276
02:51:11,000 --> 02:51:18,000
*Fuyu hurriedly stops me as I begin to stand, but immediately realizes she has nothing in specific to say.*

2277
02:51:18,000 --> 02:51:19,000
Fuyu:  "......"

2278
02:51:19,000 --> 02:51:23,000
Fuyu:  "I... don't mind if you want to stay a little while longer."

2279
02:51:23,000 --> 02:51:28,000
Fuyu:  "J-Just for a little while! And... not to talk or anything..."

2280
02:51:28,000 --> 02:51:34,000
*Since the night I spent with Mirari, she has undergone an unexpected, but not unwelcome change.*

2281
02:51:34,000 --> 02:51:39,000
*Her attentiveness has increased severalfold, and so has her attention to detail.*

2282
02:51:39,000 --> 02:51:48,000
*She's been working dutifully to earn her keep, but at the same time, she appears to be by my side every spare moment she gets.*

2283
02:51:48,000 --> 02:51:57,000
*As a result, my cabin seems to be permanently filled with the smell of food, and the entire place is cleaner than it's ever been before.*

2284
02:51:57,000 --> 02:51:59,000
*On the other hand, however--*

2285
02:51:59,000 --> 02:52:03,000
Mirari:  "[player_name], I'm all done cleaning the kitchen!"

2286
02:52:03,000 --> 02:52:05,000
Mirari:  "You know what that means."

2287
02:52:05,000 --> 02:52:08,000
You:  "{i}sigh...{/i} I know, I know."

2288
02:52:08,000 --> 02:52:09,000
You:  "Come here."

2289
02:52:09,000 --> 02:52:10,000
Mirari:  "Hyah..."

2290
02:52:10,000 --> 02:52:14,000
*Mirari lets out a brief cry of pleasure as I pat her head.*

2291
02:52:14,000 --> 02:52:19,000
Mirari:  "Mmm... That feels so good, [player_name]. Your hands are to die for."

2292
02:52:19,000 --> 02:52:23,000
Mirari:  "I don't think I'll ever be able to leave you now."

2293
02:52:23,000 --> 02:52:25,000
*(Real subtle, Mirari.)*

2294
02:52:25,000 --> 02:52:31,000
*Lately, Mirari has been really driving home the fact that she doesn't want to leave my cabin.*

2295
02:52:31,000 --> 02:52:42,000
*Strangely, Fuyu hasn't been getting on her case as much about it either. She seems to be torn about whether to reprimand Mirari, or to go along with her selfishness.*

2296
02:52:42,000 --> 02:52:47,000
*Honestly, I have no idea what I'm supposed to be doing about all of this.*

2297
02:52:47,000 --> 02:52:53,000
Mirari:  "[player_name], uhm... When you've finished reading, would you like to..."

2298
02:52:53,000 --> 02:52:57,000
Mirari:  "You know... Where we left off the other night?"

2299
02:52:57,000 --> 02:52:58,000
You:  "Huh?"

2300
02:52:58,000 --> 02:53:01,000
You:  "Mirari, what are you suggesting exactly?"

2301
02:53:01,000 --> 02:53:04,000
Mirari:  "Aww, geez... Don't make me say it!"

2302
02:53:04,000 --> 02:53:08,000
Mirari:  "You know what I'm talking about, [player_name]."

2303
02:53:08,000 --> 02:53:12,000
Fuyu:  "The entire neighborhood knows what you're talking about."

2304
02:53:12,000 --> 02:53:16,000
Fuyu:  "Can't you two lovebirds keep it to yourself?"

2305
02:53:16,000 --> 02:53:17,000
You:  "L-Lovebirds!?"

2306
02:53:17,000 --> 02:53:18,000
Mirari:  "Teehee~"

2307
02:53:18,000 --> 02:53:24,000
*Mirari smiles, her cheeks red, as she accepts Fuyu's designation without protest.*

2308
02:53:24,000 --> 02:53:30,000
Mirari:  "I suppose it would be inappropriate to go any further while Fuyu is here..."

2309
02:53:30,000 --> 02:53:34,000
Mirari:  "Very well. We'll continue this discussion later."

2310
02:53:34,000 --> 02:53:42,000
Mirari:  "For the time being I'll return to cleaning. Don't neglect to reward me once I'm finished, [player_name]."

2311
02:53:42,000 --> 02:53:43,000
You:  "Yeah... Sure."

2312
02:53:43,000 --> 02:53:45,000
You:  "Whatever you say, Mirari."

2313
02:53:45,000 --> 02:53:46,000
Fuyu:  "...Gross."

2314
02:53:46,000 --> 02:53:55,000
Fuyu:  "It was bad enough when the princess was acting on her own. Now that you've started playing along, she's getting even worse."

2315
02:53:55,000 --> 02:53:58,000
You:  "Playing along? What are you talking about?"

2316
02:53:58,000 --> 02:54:02,000
Fuyu:  "Don't play dumb. I know exactly what's going on here."

2317
02:54:02,000 --> 02:54:08,000
Fuyu:  "The princess wants to stay here with you, and you're letting her think that she can."

2318
02:54:08,000 --> 02:54:13,000
Fuyu:  "You're both using each other, yet you're too dumb to realize it."

2319
02:54:13,000 --> 02:54:16,000
You:  "Come on, Fuyu. Don't be like that."

2320
02:54:16,000 --> 02:54:20,000
You:  "Mirari and I are just making the best of a bad situation."

2321
02:54:20,000 --> 02:54:25,000
You:  "We both know that she'll be returning to her pack soon enough."

2322
02:54:25,000 --> 02:54:29,000
Fuyu:  "...Human, do you actually believe what you just said?"

2323
02:54:29,000 --> 02:54:32,000
*Fuyu narrows her eyes and glares at me coldly.*

2324
02:54:32,000 --> 02:54:37,000
Fuyu:  "The princess is serious about staying here. {i}With you.{/i}"

2325
02:54:37,000 --> 02:54:42,000
Fuyu:  "Her advances on you are not a joke, and I think you know this."

2326
02:54:42,000 --> 02:54:48,000
Fuyu:  "You're going to have to give her your answer sooner or later, [player_name]."

2327
02:54:48,000 --> 02:54:52,000
Fuyu:  "If you don't, that girl will surely force your hand."

2328
02:54:52,000 --> 02:55:00,000
*With Fuyu's warning still fresh in my mind, I spend the rest of the day replaying the past few days over and over in my mind.*

2329
02:55:00,000 --> 02:55:10,000
*From Mirari's increased skinship to her over the top attentiveness, and especially her not to subtle mentions of staying in my cabin indefinitely.*

2330
02:55:10,000 --> 02:55:15,000
*All of this, in addition to Mirari's visit to my room, paints a clear picture.*

2331
02:55:15,000 --> 02:55:19,000
*(Fuyu was right. Mirari really does want to stay here with me.)*

2332
02:55:19,000 --> 02:55:25,000
*(Not just as a resident of this cabin either. She seems to want... {i}more{/i} than that.)*

2333
02:55:25,000 --> 02:55:29,000
*(But... do I have what it takes to give Mirari what she wants?)*

2334
02:55:29,000 --> 02:55:34,000
*I turn onto my side and close my eyes as Mirari's face comes to mind.*

2335
02:55:34,000 --> 02:55:36,000
*(I like Mirari. I really do.)*

2336
02:55:36,000 --> 02:55:44,000
*(I enjoy having her here, and deep inside, there's definitely a part of me which wants her to keep staying here with me.)*

2337
02:55:44,000 --> 02:55:49,000
*(But I also know that, if I do give in to her, things will not end well.)*

2338
02:55:49,000 --> 02:55:58,000
*(Staying here with me would mean making Mirari abandon her friends and family. She would be isolated, left only with me for company.)*

2339
02:55:58,000 --> 02:56:04,000
*(If I truly cared about her, then could I bring myself to wish such a fate upon her?)*

2340
02:56:04,000 --> 02:56:07,000
Mirari:  "[player_name]? Are you... still awake?"

2341
02:56:07,000 --> 02:56:11,000
Mirari:  "I was hoping to speak to you before you fall asleep."

2342
02:56:11,000 --> 02:56:16,000
*Brought back to reality by Mirari's soothing voice, I sit up to face her.*

2343
02:56:16,000 --> 02:56:18,000
You:  "I'm still awake."

2344
02:56:18,000 --> 02:56:22,000
You:  "What's wrong, Mirari? Is something troubling you?"

2345
02:56:22,000 --> 02:56:24,000
Mirari:  "Yes... You could say that."

2346
02:56:24,000 --> 02:56:27,000
Mirari:  "Can we... possibly talk outside?"

2347
02:56:27,000 --> 02:56:33,000
*I nod, the unspoken understanding that Fuyu might be listening in such a small house.*

2348
02:56:33,000 --> 02:56:37,000
*Outside, the air is cool, but not overly unpleasant.*

2349
02:56:37,000 --> 02:56:41,000
*Mirari leads us to a small clearing near the house.*

2350
02:56:41,000 --> 02:56:46,000
*Satisfied that were far enough out of earshot from Fuyu, Mirari turns to me.*

2351
02:56:46,000 --> 02:56:50,000
Mirari:  "[player_name], I don't know if you realized this, but..."

2352
02:56:50,000 --> 02:56:56,000
Mirari:  "These past few days, I've been dropping a number of hints about staying here."

2353
02:56:56,000 --> 02:56:57,000
*("Hints", she says?)*

2354
02:56:57,000 --> 02:57:02,000
*(Hardly. There was nothing indirect or vague about her statements at all.)*

2355
02:57:02,000 --> 02:57:06,000
*Suppressing the urge to retort, I let Mirari speak.*

2356
02:57:06,000 --> 02:57:13,000
Mirari:  "[player_name], I don't want to inconvenience you, or to pressure you into making a decision."

2357
02:57:13,000 --> 02:57:20,000
Mirari:  "However, I don't have the leisure of waiting indefinitely while you decide my fate either."

2358
02:57:20,000 --> 02:57:24,000
Mirari:  "So... I want to ask you directly, right here and now."

2359
02:57:24,000 --> 02:57:29,000
Mirari:  "[player_name]... Will you let me stay with you, here in this cabin?"

2360
02:57:29,000 --> 02:57:35,000
*I bite my lip as Mirari's watery eyes bore into my skull as I struggle to answer her.*

2361
02:57:35,000 --> 02:57:39,000
*Truthfully, her question is one I don't yet have an answer to.*

2362
02:57:39,000 --> 02:57:49,000
*It's a serious question, with equally serious consequences. It's something I need time to think about, lest I do something reckless or irresponsible.*

2363
02:57:49,000 --> 02:57:57,000
*Be that as it may, time is not on my side. Just as Mirari stated, she can't wait forever, nor can I expect her to.*

2364
02:57:57,000 --> 02:58:08,000
*Mirari requires an answer sooner rather than later. Her pack needs to know if she will lead it, and Mirari must begin to plan the next stage of her life accordingly.*

2365
02:58:08,000 --> 02:58:17,000
*Unfortunately for Mirari, however, if I'm being forced to reach a decision right this second, then it won't be the one she wants to hear.*

2366
02:58:17,000 --> 02:58:21,000
You:  "...I'm sorry, Mirari, but... my answer is no."

2367
02:58:21,000 --> 02:58:23,000
You:  "I can't let you stay here."

2368
02:58:23,000 --> 02:58:24,000
Mirari:  "......"

2369
02:58:24,000 --> 02:58:26,000
Mirari:  "I... I see..."

2370
02:58:26,000 --> 02:58:30,000
Mirari:  "...I apologize for asking such a selfish question."

2371
02:58:30,000 --> 02:58:35,000
Mirari:  "It was wrong of me to attempt to force myself on you like this."

2372
02:58:35,000 --> 02:58:43,000
*With her lips quivering and her hands clenched tightly, Mirari looks down at her feet as she fights back tears.*

2373
02:58:43,000 --> 02:58:48,000
*Try as she might to put on a brave face, her disappointment is clear.*

2374
02:58:48,000 --> 02:58:52,000
Mirari:  "I'm sorry, [player_name]... I'm so, so sorry."

2375
02:58:52,000 --> 02:59:02,000
Mirari:  "I've been nothing but a burden to you this entire time. And now that it's time to go, I'm trying to take advantage of your kindness once more."

2376
02:59:02,000 --> 02:59:05,000
Mirari:  "I am a truly detestable person."

2377
02:59:05,000 --> 02:59:08,000
You:  "You're wrong! That isn't it at all!"

2378
02:59:08,000 --> 02:59:13,000
*I grab Mirari's shoulders firmly and force her to look into my eyes.*

2379
02:59:13,000 --> 02:59:16,000
You:  "Mirari, you haven't been a burden!"

2380
02:59:16,000 --> 02:59:23,000
You:  "In fact, it's been a pleasure to have you here! Any human would be {i}lucky{/i} to take you in!"

2381
02:59:23,000 --> 02:59:27,000
You:  "It's just... I'm doing this for your own good."

2382
02:59:27,000 --> 02:59:35,000
You:  "I know about your situation back home, and why you want to leave. But that's exactly why I can't take you in."

2383
02:59:35,000 --> 02:59:39,000
You:  "Mirari... You can't stay here with me like this."

2384
02:59:39,000 --> 02:59:44,000
You:  "You need to return to your pack, before you've lost them forever."

2385
02:59:44,000 --> 02:59:52,000
Mirari:  "But... But you said that you're out here to be free. To get away from your family that expected so much of you."

2386
02:59:52,000 --> 02:59:57,000
You:  "I know, and I'm sorry. In reality our situations are not the same, Mirari."

2387
02:59:57,000 --> 03:00:03,000
You:  "You have actual lives counting on you, while I gave up when things got too difficult."

2388
03:00:03,000 --> 03:00:12,000
You:  "I ran away before I even tried to take over the company. Now I'll never know if it would have been too much for me or not."

2389
03:00:12,000 --> 03:00:17,000
You:  "I'm not out here because of freedom, I'm out here because I ran away."

2390
03:00:17,000 --> 03:00:21,000
You:  "And I don't want you to make that same mistake."

2391
03:00:21,000 --> 03:00:24,000
Mirari:  "...You are too kind, [player_name]."

2392
03:00:24,000 --> 03:00:30,000
Mirari:  "Even now, when I'm troubling you so, you're still trying to spare my feelings."

2393
03:00:30,000 --> 03:00:33,000
Mirari:  "But... you don't need to pretend anymore."

2394
03:00:33,000 --> 03:00:41,000
Mirari:  "If you simply tell me that you dislike me, or do not want me around you anymore, I will leave without a fight."

2395
03:00:41,000 --> 03:00:42,000
You:  "Ahh, geez...!"

2396
03:00:42,000 --> 03:00:44,000
You:  "Fine. Have it your way."

2397
03:00:44,000 --> 03:00:48,000
You:  "If words won't get through to you, then maybe actions will!"

2398
03:00:48,000 --> 03:00:51,000
Mirari:  "[player_name]!? Wh-What are you--"

2399
03:00:51,000 --> 03:00:52,000
Mirari:  "Mmmph!?"

2400
03:00:52,000 --> 03:00:57,000
*Before Mirari can protest, I grab her shoulders and press my lips against hers.*

2401
03:00:57,000 --> 03:01:04,000
*Forcefully, yet not so hard as to hurt her, I kiss Mirari, causing her eyes to open wide in surprise.*

2402
03:01:04,000 --> 03:01:07,000
*Despite her shock, Mirari does not push me away.*

2403
03:01:07,000 --> 03:01:09,000
Mirari:  "Mmmm... {i}haa...{/i}"

2404
03:01:09,000 --> 03:01:11,000
Mirari:  "[player_name]..."

2405
03:01:11,000 --> 03:01:17,000
*Her surprise has turned into lust, and she isn't prepared to let me go so quickly.*

2406
03:01:17,000 --> 03:01:20,000
Mirari:  "[player_name], does this mean...?"

2407
03:01:20,000 --> 03:01:21,000
You:  "...Yeah."

2408
03:01:21,000 --> 03:01:26,000
You:  "I like you, Mirari. More than anyone I've known in a very long time."

2409
03:01:26,000 --> 03:01:35,000
You:  "Before I met you, I thought I was destined to live the rest of my life out here in solitude, far away from everyone and everything."

2410
03:01:35,000 --> 03:01:43,000
You:  "But being here with you, Mirari... You've reminded me of the good that comes from being with other people."

2411
03:01:43,000 --> 03:01:54,000
You:  "I wasn't just trying to make you feel better earlier, Mirari. I really have enjoyed your company, and I would be overjoyed to have you here with me from now on."

2412
03:01:54,000 --> 03:01:57,000
You:  "...But that's also why I have to let you go."

2413
03:01:57,000 --> 03:02:01,000
*Mirari's joyful smile turns into one of sadness in a heartbeat.*

2414
03:02:01,000 --> 03:02:07,000
*No matter how many nice words I pile up, the end result is still that Mirari must go.*

2415
03:02:07,000 --> 03:02:08,000
Mirari:  "...Why...?"

2416
03:02:08,000 --> 03:02:11,000
Mirari:  "I don't... I don't understand..."

2417
03:02:11,000 --> 03:02:15,000
Mirari:  "If you care about me too, then why... can't I stay here?"

2418
03:02:15,000 --> 03:02:18,000
Mirari:  "Why can't we be together...!?"

2419
03:02:18,000 --> 03:02:19,000
Mirari:  "Why...!?"

2420
03:02:19,000 --> 03:02:20,000
*I don't answer.*

2421
03:02:20,000 --> 03:02:23,000
Mirari:  "Why do things have to be this way...?"

2422
03:02:23,000 --> 03:02:28,000
Mirari:  "All I want is to stay here with you, just as I have been until now."

2423
03:02:28,000 --> 03:02:30,000
Mirari:  "Why won't you let me...!?"

2424
03:02:30,000 --> 03:02:35,000
*Once again, I kiss Mirari's cheek while I avoid making eye contact.*

2425
03:02:35,000 --> 03:02:43,000
*Even without looking at her, I can tell that she's crying; every convulsion of her body is transmitted to me clearly.*

2426
03:02:43,000 --> 03:02:47,000
Mirari:  "I wish... {i}*sniff*{/i} I wish I was born human."

2427
03:02:47,000 --> 03:02:56,000
Mirari:  "Then I would be free to choose my own life, without worrying about the pack, or about doing what's best for everyone."

2428
03:02:56,000 --> 03:03:03,000
Mirari:  "But more than that, if I were human, then maybe... I could have been together with you after all."

2429
03:03:03,000 --> 03:03:13,000
*Given time to process what was said, both girls gradually return to their usual selves, and we go back to how we were before our trip to the hot spring.*

2430
03:03:13,000 --> 03:03:20,000
*Aside from the occasional sidelong glance, we've returned to our previous dynamic without incident.*

2431
03:03:20,000 --> 03:03:23,000
Fuyu:  "Come on, Princess. What's taking so long?"

2432
03:03:23,000 --> 03:03:26,000
Fuyu:  "Just pick a movie and put it in."

2433
03:03:26,000 --> 03:03:28,000
Mirari:  "I-I need another minute."

2434
03:03:28,000 --> 03:03:34,000
Mirari:  "I've narrowed my choice down to two tapes, but I'm having a hard time deciding on one."

2435
03:03:34,000 --> 03:03:39,000
Fuyu:  "So watch one tonight and one tomorrow. It's not a big deal."

2436
03:03:39,000 --> 03:03:41,000
Mirari:  "Yeah, but... {i}Uuu...{/i}"

2437
03:03:41,000 --> 03:03:45,000
Mirari:  "[player_name], can we watch both of these tonight?"

2438
03:03:45,000 --> 03:03:49,000
You:  "No. You pick one, Fuyu picks one. That's what we agreed on."

2439
03:03:49,000 --> 03:03:51,000
Mirari:  "Aww... No fair."

2440
03:03:51,000 --> 03:03:57,000
*Mirari sulks as she goes back to deciding which movie she wants to watch tonight.*

2441
03:03:57,000 --> 03:04:01,000
*(Sheesh. Mirari's acting more and more human by the day.)*

2442
03:04:01,000 --> 03:04:11,000
*(I was right to worry about the negative impact of having the girls stay here. They seem to be getting just a little bit too used to human culture.)*

2443
03:04:11,000 --> 03:04:17,000
*(At the rate things are going, they really won't be able to re-integrate back into their pack.)*

2444
03:04:17,000 --> 03:04:20,000
*I leave the girls alone and walk into the kitchen.*

2445
03:04:20,000 --> 03:04:27,000
*I then turn on the radio to listen for any changes in the weather, and any plans to have the paths cleared.*

2446
03:04:27,000 --> 03:04:34,000
*(I enjoy having those two here, but we really do need to get them home sooner rather than later.)*

2447
03:04:34,000 --> 03:04:41,000
*(The longer they stay, the more difficult it's going to be on all of us when they inevitably leave.)*

2448
03:04:41,000 --> 03:04:46,000
*After listening to the radio for a short while, I turn it back off.*

2449
03:04:46,000 --> 03:04:50,000
*With a smile on my lips, I return to the living room.*

2450
03:04:50,000 --> 03:04:55,000
*(Oh well. No use worrying about it while the paths are still blocked.)*

2451
03:04:55,000 --> 03:05:01,000
*(Once a clear route back to the girls' den has surfaced, {i}then{/i} we'll talk.)*

2452
03:05:01,000 --> 03:05:05,000
Mirari:  "[player_name], [player_name]! I've reached a decision!"

2453
03:05:05,000 --> 03:05:06,000
You:  "...You have?"

2454
03:05:06,000 --> 03:05:08,000
*(About returning home?)*

2455
03:05:08,000 --> 03:05:09,000
Mirari:  "Uh-huh."

2456
03:05:09,000 --> 03:05:18,000
Mirari:  "Tonight, we'll watch the rest of the grasslands documentary. Then tomorrow, we'll watch this movie about the man of iron."

2457
03:05:18,000 --> 03:05:22,000
You:  "Ohh, you were talking about what we'll be watching."

2458
03:05:22,000 --> 03:05:28,000
You:  "Alright, sounds good to me. Though I didn't pick you for a fan of superheroes."

2459
03:05:28,000 --> 03:05:30,000
Mirari:  "Superheroes?"

2460
03:05:30,000 --> 03:05:33,000
You:  "Yeah, that second movie you picked."

2461
03:05:33,000 --> 03:05:39,000
You:  "It's about a person with a suit of high-tech armor who goes around fighting bad guys."

2462
03:05:39,000 --> 03:05:42,000
Mirari:  "Oh... Is that what it's about?"

2463
03:05:42,000 --> 03:05:46,000
Mirari:  "I thought it was an educational film about blacksmiths."

2464
03:05:46,000 --> 03:05:49,000
*(Why would I even have something like that?)*

2465
03:05:49,000 --> 03:05:53,000
Mirari:  "Hrm... In that case, I'll pick something else."

2466
03:05:53,000 --> 03:05:55,000
Mirari:  "I'm not fond of violence."

2467
03:05:55,000 --> 03:05:57,000
You:  "Alright, you go do--"

2468
03:05:57,000 --> 03:05:58,000
*{i}*crunch*{/i}*

2469
03:05:58,000 --> 03:05:59,000
You:  "...That."

2470
03:05:59,000 --> 03:06:03,000
*I look down at my feet as I hear a crunching sound from below.*

2471
03:06:03,000 --> 03:06:08,000
*When I raise my foot, I notice numerous crumbs of food on the rug.*

2472
03:06:08,000 --> 03:06:13,000
You:  "...Mirari, I thought you'd already cleaned the living room today?"

2473
03:06:13,000 --> 03:06:14,000
Mirari:  "Hmm?"

2474
03:06:14,000 --> 03:06:17,000
Mirari:  "Oh, yes. The food scraps on the floor."

2475
03:06:17,000 --> 03:06:21,000
Mirari:  "My apologies. I haven't yet started to sweep those up."

2476
03:06:21,000 --> 03:06:23,000
You:  "{i}Sweep{/i} them up?"

2477
03:06:23,000 --> 03:06:28,000
Mirari:  "Yes. I will start shortly, right after I have picked another movie."

2478
03:06:28,000 --> 03:06:34,000
You:  "No, no, no. You don't need to sweep anything up. With a rug it will be too difficult."

2479
03:06:34,000 --> 03:06:37,000
You:  "Haven't you ever heard of a vacuum cleaner?"

2480
03:06:37,000 --> 03:06:39,000
Mirari:  "Vacuum... cleaner?"

2481
03:06:39,000 --> 03:06:44,000
You:  "{i}sigh...{/i} Never mind. It'll be quicker to just show you how it works."

2482
03:06:44,000 --> 03:06:50,000
*I head into the storeroom and find the vacuum cleaner tucked away in the back corner.*

2483
03:06:50,000 --> 03:06:56,000
*After making sure it's fully charged, I bring it back into the living room, turn it on, and--*

2484
03:06:56,000 --> 03:06:58,000
*{i}*VRRRRRRRRRMMMMMMMM*{/i}*

2485
03:06:58,000 --> 03:07:00,000
Mirari:  "Arf! Arararf!"

2486
03:07:00,000 --> 03:07:04,000
Mirari:  "[player_name], be careful! That thing is...!"

2487
03:07:04,000 --> 03:07:10,000
*Mirari walks backwards into the kitchen, looking for a weapon to defend herself with.*

2488
03:07:10,000 --> 03:07:12,000
You:  "No, no, Mirari, settle down."

2489
03:07:12,000 --> 03:07:14,000
You:  "This machine is--"

2490
03:07:14,000 --> 03:07:16,000
Fuyu:  "Ahh! Another one!"

2491
03:07:16,000 --> 03:07:19,000
Fuyu:  "And this one managed to get into the cabin!"

2492
03:07:19,000 --> 03:07:23,000
Fuyu:  "Quick, Princess, behind me! I'll take it out!"

2493
03:07:23,000 --> 03:07:24,000
Mirari:  "Fuyu!"

2494
03:07:24,000 --> 03:07:29,000
Mirari:  "Please, be careful. It already has [player_name] cornered."

2495
03:07:29,000 --> 03:07:31,000
Fuyu:  "Not on my watch!"

2496
03:07:31,000 --> 03:07:34,000
You:  "Girls, come on. Not this again."

2497
03:07:34,000 --> 03:07:40,000
You:  "I know the noise unsettles you, but it's just a machine. It won't hurt you."

2498
03:07:40,000 --> 03:07:45,000
Fuyu:  "That's what you said about the last one, and it swallowed you whole!"

2499
03:07:45,000 --> 03:07:48,000
Fuyu:  "I'm not taking any chances with this one."

2500
03:07:48,000 --> 03:07:54,000
*Having cleaned the floor around where we usually eat, I turn the vacuum cleaner off.*

2501
03:07:54,000 --> 03:07:59,000
*The moment I do, the noise stops, and both wolf-girls begin to relax.*

2502
03:07:59,000 --> 03:08:01,000
Mirari:  "Is it... is it dead...?"

2503
03:08:01,000 --> 03:08:06,000
Fuyu:  "Careful, Princess. It may be lulling us into a false sense of security."

2504
03:08:06,000 --> 03:08:08,000
Fuyu:  "Allow me to investigate."

2505
03:08:08,000 --> 03:08:10,000
Mirari:  "O... Okay... Be careful."

2506
03:08:10,000 --> 03:08:12,000
Fuyu:  "Easy does it... Easy..."

2507
03:08:12,000 --> 03:08:13,000
Fuyu:  "Now!"

2508
03:08:13,000 --> 03:08:15,000
You:  "H-Hey! What are you--"

2509
03:08:15,000 --> 03:08:16,000
You:  "Stop that!"

2510
03:08:16,000 --> 03:08:18,000
Fuyu:  "{i}*chomp*{/i}"

2511
03:08:18,000 --> 03:08:25,000
*The moment Fuyu enters striking range, she lunges at the vacuum cleaner and sinks her teeth into it.*

2512
03:08:25,000 --> 03:08:29,000
You:  "Fuyu, stop that! You don't need to attack it!"

2513
03:08:29,000 --> 03:08:32,000
You:  "It's... It's already dead, okay?"

2514
03:08:32,000 --> 03:08:35,000
Mirari:  "A-Are you sure, [player_name]?"

2515
03:08:35,000 --> 03:08:38,000
You:  "Yes, I'm sure! So stop biting it, Fuyu!"

2516
03:08:38,000 --> 03:08:40,000
Fuyu:  "...Hmph. If you insist."

2517
03:08:40,000 --> 03:08:43,000
Fuyu:  "It didn't taste very good anyway."

2518
03:08:43,000 --> 03:08:46,000
You:  "Of course it didn't. It's plastic!"

2519
03:08:46,000 --> 03:08:53,000
*Patting herself on the back while enjoying praise from her princess, Fuyu leads Mirari into the next room.*

2520
03:08:53,000 --> 03:09:00,000
*Meanwhile, I assess the damage to the vacuum cleaner, which thankfully isn't as bad as it seemed.*

2521
03:09:00,000 --> 03:09:05,000
You:  "For crying out loud. How many times do I have to tell those girls?"

2522
03:09:05,000 --> 03:09:13,000
You:  "Maybe I should send them to the hot spring or something the next time I want to use the vacuum, or the truck."

2523
03:09:13,000 --> 03:09:19,000
You:  "I mean, in a way I guess it's good that they aren't completely used to life here."

2524
03:09:19,000 --> 03:09:26,000
You:  "If they're going to rejoin their pack, then it's for the best that they don't get too comfortable here."

2525
03:09:26,000 --> 03:09:34,000
You:  "But really... of all the things I wish they'd learn while they stay here, not attacking appliances is a pretty big one."

2526
03:09:34,000 --> 03:09:41,000
*Grumbling to myself, I take the vacuum cleaner back to the storeroom and put it where I found it.*

2527
03:09:41,000 --> 03:09:46,000
You:  "Still... maybe it wouldn't be so bad if the girls got used to life here."

2528
03:09:46,000 --> 03:09:55,000
You:  "I mean, I do want what's best for them, and I'm certain that "what's best" is for them to return to their pack. But even so..."

2529
03:09:55,000 --> 03:10:03,000
You:  "If, hypothetically, they {i}couldn't{/i} return to their pack, then... it's not like it would be the end of the world."

2530
03:10:03,000 --> 03:10:04,000
You:  "......"

2531
03:10:04,000 --> 03:10:07,000
*Conflicted, I return to the living room.*

2532
03:10:07,000 --> 03:10:13,000
You:  "Oh well. I guess it's a needless concern, as long as the path is still blocked."

2533
03:10:13,000 --> 03:10:18,000
You:  "Right now, we're all stuck together, whether we like it or--"

2534
03:10:18,000 --> 03:10:20,000
*{i}*bang* *bang* *bang*{/i}*

2535
03:10:20,000 --> 03:10:23,000
???:  "Princess! Princess, are you there!?"

2536
03:10:23,000 --> 03:10:29,000
???:  "I followed your scent to this cabin. Please, Princess, if you're in there, answer me!"

2537
03:10:29,000 --> 03:10:32,000
Mirari:  "A... A visitor...? For me...?"

2538
03:10:32,000 --> 03:10:34,000
Mirari:  "And that voice..."

2539
03:10:34,000 --> 03:10:37,000
Fuyu:  "Princess, it is someone from our pack!"

2540
03:10:37,000 --> 03:10:40,000
Fuyu:  "They found a way through the snow!"

2541
03:10:40,000 --> 03:10:43,000
Mirari:  "Ah... Yes. That must be it."

2542
03:10:43,000 --> 03:10:46,000
Fuyu:  "Quickly, let us see to her at once!"

2543
03:10:46,000 --> 03:10:47,000
Mirari:  "...Mm."

2544
03:10:47,000 --> 03:10:51,000
*With a solemn look on her face, Mirari walks over to the door.*

2545
03:10:51,000 --> 03:10:58,000
*She then unlocks the door and begins to open it, at which point her facial expression changes immediately.*

2546
03:10:58,000 --> 03:11:00,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Princess!"

2547
03:11:00,000 --> 03:11:02,000
Mirari:  "O-Oh my goodness..."

2548
03:11:02,000 --> 03:11:05,000
Fuyu:  "What... What happened to you?"

2549
03:11:05,000 --> 03:11:09,000
Fuyu:  "Was the trek over here truly so treacherous?"

2550
03:11:09,000 --> 03:11:14,000
*When the girls open the door, what awaits them is another wolf-girl.*

2551
03:11:14,000 --> 03:11:20,000
*Unlike Mirari and Fuyu, however, the girl before them appears to be heavily injured.*

2552
03:11:20,000 --> 03:11:25,000
Wolf-Girl:  "No... {i}*cough*{/i} The path is clear. There is no problem there."

2553
03:11:25,000 --> 03:11:29,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Before the path was cleared, however..."

2554
03:11:29,000 --> 03:11:33,000
*The injured girl looks Mirari in the eye as she speaks.*

2555
03:11:33,000 --> 03:11:36,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Princess, your mother..."

2556
03:11:36,000 --> 03:11:38,000
Mirari:  "My... My mother...?"

2557
03:11:38,000 --> 03:11:41,000
Mirari:  "What about my mother!? Is she okay!?"

2558
03:11:41,000 --> 03:11:42,000
Wolf-Girl:  "......"

2559
03:11:42,000 --> 03:11:49,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Princess, the avalanche which occurred during your absence injured many of us. Myself included."

2560
03:11:49,000 --> 03:11:55,000
Wolf-Girl:  "For every one of us injured by the avalanche, however, two more were killed."

2561
03:11:55,000 --> 03:12:00,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Among those killed by the avalanche was... your mother."

2562
03:12:00,000 --> 03:12:02,000
Fuyu:  "The queen... is dead!?"

2563
03:12:02,000 --> 03:12:04,000
Mirari:  "Oh, no... No, no, no...!"

2564
03:12:04,000 --> 03:12:10,000
Wolf-Girl:  "My deepest apologies, Princess, but there is no time for you to grieve."

2565
03:12:10,000 --> 03:12:15,000
Wolf-Girl:  "After your mother's passing, you were presumed dead as well."

2566
03:12:15,000 --> 03:12:20,000
Wolf-Girl:  "In light of that... a challenge was made for the throne."

2567
03:12:20,000 --> 03:12:22,000
Fuyu:  "A... A challenge...?"

2568
03:12:22,000 --> 03:12:24,000
Fuyu:  "Who would dare!?"

2569
03:12:24,000 --> 03:12:27,000
Wolf-Girl:  "One of the surviving hunters."

2570
03:12:27,000 --> 03:12:34,000
Wolf-Girl:  "He took advantage of the confusion and loss of life to declare himself the new alpha male."

2571
03:12:34,000 --> 03:12:43,000
Wolf-Girl:  "If you don't hurry back, Princess, he truly will become the new pack leader, and take from you what is rightfully yours!"

2572
03:12:43,000 --> 03:12:49,000
*The injured wolf-girl barely remains standing, supported solely by desperation and anger.*

2573
03:12:49,000 --> 03:12:53,000
Fuyu:  "Princess, did you hear that? We must leave at once!"

2574
03:12:53,000 --> 03:12:55,000
Mirari:  "M... Mother..."

2575
03:12:55,000 --> 03:12:58,000
Fuyu:  "This is no time for mourning!"

2576
03:12:58,000 --> 03:13:04,000
Fuyu:  "If you wish to honor your mother's memory, then claim the throne she left to you!"

2577
03:13:04,000 --> 03:13:06,000
Mirari:  "But... But I..."

2578
03:13:06,000 --> 03:13:08,000
*("Don't even want the throne"?)*

2579
03:13:08,000 --> 03:13:16,000
*Those words which Mirari cannot say in front of her injured kin are transmitted to me directly, as clear as day.*

2580
03:13:16,000 --> 03:13:22,000
*What weighs on her mind is not the leadership of her pack, but the death of her beloved mother.*

2581
03:13:22,000 --> 03:13:28,000
*Unfortunately, the other two wolf-girls present are not about to give her the time to grieve.*

2582
03:13:28,000 --> 03:13:33,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Princess, please! You must return and take the throne!"

2583
03:13:33,000 --> 03:13:37,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Too many of us have already been killed or injured."

2584
03:13:37,000 --> 03:13:43,000
Wolf-Girl:  "What we need now more than ever is the stability of the royal family's leadership!"

2585
03:13:43,000 --> 03:13:49,000
Fuyu:  "I agree, Princess. If we do not return now, who knows what fate will befall our pack?"

2586
03:13:49,000 --> 03:13:55,000
Fuyu:  "Take on the role left to you by your parents, Princess. Become our new leader!"

2587
03:13:55,000 --> 03:14:00,000
Mirari:  "I... I understand what you're asking of me... I really do... but..."

2588
03:14:00,000 --> 03:14:05,000
*Avoiding the gazes of the two insistent wolf-girls, Mirari looks to me for help.*

2589
03:14:05,000 --> 03:14:11,000
*Staring at me pleadingly, she appears to be on the brink of tears as she seeks my advice.*

2590
03:14:11,000 --> 03:14:15,000
*Unfortunately for Mirari, I agree with her clansmen.*

2591
03:14:15,000 --> 03:14:17,000
You:  "...You need to go, Mirari."

2592
03:14:17,000 --> 03:14:19,000
Mirari:  "[player_name]...?"

2593
03:14:19,000 --> 03:14:21,000
You:  "This is your fight, Mirari."

2594
03:14:21,000 --> 03:14:27,000
You:  "It's for the future of your pack, which both of your parents died to protect."

2595
03:14:27,000 --> 03:14:32,000
You:  "If you don't go, you're going to regret it for the rest of your life."

2596
03:14:32,000 --> 03:14:33,000
Mirari:  "But I..."

2597
03:14:33,000 --> 03:14:36,000
You:  "It's okay. I'll look after your friend here."

2598
03:14:36,000 --> 03:14:44,000
You:  "When you're done sorting out your pack business, I'll still be right here, waiting to hear the good news."

2599
03:14:44,000 --> 03:14:47,000
You:  "So... leave. Return to your pack."

2600
03:14:47,000 --> 03:14:55,000
You:  "And then, when all of this is over, if you still want to come back and see me, I'll welcome you with open arms."

2601
03:14:55,000 --> 03:14:57,000
Mirari:  "...Very well."

2602
03:14:57,000 --> 03:14:58,000
Mirari:  "Let us--"

2603
03:14:58,000 --> 03:15:00,000
You:  "Hang on a second."

2604
03:15:00,000 --> 03:15:06,000
*I interrupt Mirari mid-sentence, causing the wolf-girls to look at me in surprise.*

2605
03:15:06,000 --> 03:15:11,000
You:  "I know I said that you should leave, but I didn't mean {i}right now{/i}."

2606
03:15:11,000 --> 03:15:18,000
You:  "Stay here for tonight. Eat well, sleep well, and prepare yourself for what you'll soon be facing."

2607
03:15:18,000 --> 03:15:19,000
Mirari:  "But I...!"

2608
03:15:19,000 --> 03:15:24,000
*I place my index finger over Mirari's lips as she tries to protest.*

2609
03:15:24,000 --> 03:15:30,000
You:  "You've almost died twice in the short time we've known one another, Mirari."

2610
03:15:30,000 --> 03:15:33,000
You:  "Please... don't tempt fate a third time."

2611
03:15:33,000 --> 03:15:39,000
You:  "Make whatever preparations you need to tonight, then settle everything tomorrow."

2612
03:15:39,000 --> 03:15:42,000
You:  "Would you do that for me, Mirari?"

2613
03:15:42,000 --> 03:15:43,000
Mirari:  "......"

2614
03:15:43,000 --> 03:15:45,000
Mirari:  "Alright. I understand."

2615
03:15:45,000 --> 03:15:51,000
Mirari:  "If you're the one asking me, [player_name], then... I will do as you say."

2616
03:15:51,000 --> 03:15:54,000
Fuyu:  "Now hold on just a minute there!"

2617
03:15:54,000 --> 03:16:00,000
Fuyu:  "We don't have time to play around here any longer! Even now, our kin must be--"

2618
03:16:00,000 --> 03:16:01,000
You:  "You too, Fuyu."

2619
03:16:01,000 --> 03:16:02,000
Fuyu:  "...Eh?"

2620
03:16:02,000 --> 03:16:08,000
*I place my hand, which was resting on Mirari's lips a moment ago, on Fuyu's shoulder.*

2621
03:16:08,000 --> 03:16:16,000
You:  "I know you feel like you need to go right this second, without any delay, but please... think about this for a second."

2622
03:16:16,000 --> 03:16:22,000
You:  "Your friend needs urgent care, and Mirari has just learned of her mother's death."

2623
03:16:22,000 --> 03:16:28,000
You:  "Do you really think that rushing head-first into the action is the right thing to do?"

2624
03:16:28,000 --> 03:16:30,000
Fuyu:  "Well... that is..."

2625
03:16:30,000 --> 03:16:35,000
You:  "And of course, there's your own health to worry about as well, Fuyu."

2626
03:16:35,000 --> 03:16:36,000
Fuyu:  "M-Mine?"

2627
03:16:36,000 --> 03:16:37,000
You:  "That's right."

2628
03:16:37,000 --> 03:16:41,000
You:  "You're on-edge, surprised, and feeling restless."

2629
03:16:41,000 --> 03:16:46,000
You:  "You're worried about your kin, but also about your friends right here."

2630
03:16:46,000 --> 03:16:53,000
You:  "If you go out there while your head is muddled, you're only going to wind up getting hurt."

2631
03:16:53,000 --> 03:16:59,000
You:  "And the last thing I want is for you to end up in the same state as your friend here."

2632
03:16:59,000 --> 03:17:01,000
Fuyu:  "[player_name]..."

2633
03:17:01,000 --> 03:17:06,000
*With slightly reddened cheeks, Fuyu opens her eyes wide and stares at me.*

2634
03:17:06,000 --> 03:17:07,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Ahem!"

2635
03:17:07,000 --> 03:17:08,000
Fuyu:  "Hyah!?"

2636
03:17:08,000 --> 03:17:13,000
*Fuyu jumps in surprise as her injured friend suddenly clears her throat.*

2637
03:17:13,000 --> 03:17:18,000
*Mirari and Fuyu both look down at their feet as their friend chides them.*

2638
03:17:18,000 --> 03:17:25,000
*The injured wolf-girl doesn't mince her words, nor does she display any joy on her face as she speaks.*

2639
03:17:25,000 --> 03:17:29,000
*She truly is bewildered by the choices of her companions.*

2640
03:17:29,000 --> 03:17:33,000
Wolf-Girl:  "That being said... the human may have a point."

2641
03:17:33,000 --> 03:17:41,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Our opponent is formidable. If you go out there without a plan, you'll likely wind up rushing to your deaths."

2642
03:17:41,000 --> 03:17:48,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Before you leave, let me explain to you in depth what is going on, and who you are up against."

2643
03:17:48,000 --> 03:17:54,000
*For the next couple of hours, the wolf-girls talk to their friend while treating her wounds.*

2644
03:17:54,000 --> 03:18:00,000
*Mirari and Fuyu listen intently to the events that have transpired during their absence.*

2645
03:18:00,000 --> 03:18:08,000
*From the search for Mirari to the avalanche and coup, all of the drama is recounted for the sake of the two girls.*

2646
03:18:08,000 --> 03:18:10,000
Mirari:  "Mother... I had no idea..."

2647
03:18:10,000 --> 03:18:14,000
Fuyu:  "While we were idling around here, our pack has been..."

2648
03:18:14,000 --> 03:18:20,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Yes. I'm afraid things haven't been going well since your disappearance, Princess."

2649
03:18:20,000 --> 03:18:26,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Most of the problems we now face are the result of recent weather conditions."

2650
03:18:26,000 --> 03:18:32,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Be that as it may, the absence of a leader has naturally compounded the issue."

2651
03:18:32,000 --> 03:18:37,000
Fuyu:  "I can't believe everyone fell to pieces the moment our leader perished."

2652
03:18:37,000 --> 03:18:43,000
Fuyu:  "Functioning as a pack is great and all, but when did we all lose our sense of autonomy?"

2653
03:18:43,000 --> 03:18:46,000
Mirari:  "It's because I wasn't there..."

2654
03:18:46,000 --> 03:18:50,000
Mirari:  "If I had just stayed put, then this would all..."

2655
03:18:50,000 --> 03:18:53,000
*Mirari and Fuyu lament the state of their pack.*

2656
03:18:53,000 --> 03:19:01,000
*With heavy hearts, they regret their absence in their pack's time of need, and the consequences of their actions.*

2657
03:19:01,000 --> 03:19:09,000
*Even if they weren't directly responsible for anything that has happened, they understand the impact their decisions.*

2658
03:19:09,000 --> 03:19:15,000
Fuyu:  "The one who's trying to take over... Does he have the support of the pack?"

2659
03:19:15,000 --> 03:19:17,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Not especially."

2660
03:19:17,000 --> 03:19:28,000
Wolf-Girl:  "However, in a time where we've lost a great number of our members, and everyone is frightened, a strong male presence is not to be underestimated."

2661
03:19:28,000 --> 03:19:37,000
Wolf-Girl:  "The pack needs a leader now more than ever. If this matter is left alone, it won't be long before he gains the pack's support."

2662
03:19:37,000 --> 03:19:39,000
Fuyu:  "That is troublesome..."

2663
03:19:39,000 --> 03:19:43,000
Fuyu:  "When you say a "strong male", do you mean...?"

2664
03:19:43,000 --> 03:19:46,000
Wolf-Girl:  "I meant that literally, yes."

2665
03:19:46,000 --> 03:19:52,000
Wolf-Girl:  "To be blunt, even if you both fought him at once, you wouldn't stand a chance."

2666
03:19:52,000 --> 03:19:58,000
Wolf-Girl:  "If you are to defeat him in combat, you must come up with a solid strategy."

2667
03:19:58,000 --> 03:20:05,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Set traps, lure him onto thin ice, use weapons from this human's house... Do whatever it takes."

2668
03:20:05,000 --> 03:20:08,000
Mirari:  "...Is fighting really the only way?"

2669
03:20:08,000 --> 03:20:14,000
Mirari:  "Even if we do defeat him, it won't bring back those who have already been killed."

2670
03:20:14,000 --> 03:20:21,000
Wolf-Girl:  "No, but it {i}will{/i} secure your position as pack leader, and restore the pack's stability."

2671
03:20:21,000 --> 03:20:23,000
Mirari:  "...Even so..."

2672
03:20:23,000 --> 03:20:27,000
Fuyu:  "Don't worry, Princess. You needn't lift a finger."

2673
03:20:27,000 --> 03:20:31,000
Fuyu:  "I will take care of that traitor all by myself."

2674
03:20:31,000 --> 03:20:38,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Fuyu... I understand how you feel, but I don't think you should take this man on solo."

2675
03:20:38,000 --> 03:20:44,000
Wolf-Girl:  "In a battle to the death, one more set of hands can easily sway the outcome."

2676
03:20:44,000 --> 03:20:49,000
*While the girls talk strategy, I head into the kitchen and start to make lunch.*

2677
03:20:49,000 --> 03:20:55,000
*I try to focus on the task and hand, but for the most part, I find myself deep in thought.*

2678
03:20:55,000 --> 03:21:04,000
*Tormented by the reality of what my guests will soon face, I begin to feel like our time together is finally about to come to an end.*

2679
03:21:04,000 --> 03:21:10,000
*(Having those two leave my home was supposed to be what I've wanted from the very beginning.)*

2680
03:21:10,000 --> 03:21:17,000
*(And yet, rather than see them off with a smile on my face, as I should have... I stopped them.)*

2681
03:21:17,000 --> 03:21:19,000
*(Why? Why did I do that?)*

2682
03:21:19,000 --> 03:21:28,000
*(Mirari and Fuyu are going to return to their pack. They will be reunited with their friends and family, and resume their day to day lives.)*

2683
03:21:28,000 --> 03:21:38,000
*(I'll return to my life of solitude. I won't need to take care of anyone else, or show consideration for anyone else. I'll be able to live as I choose.)*

2684
03:21:38,000 --> 03:21:41,000
*(This is what's best for everyone. I know it is.)*

2685
03:21:41,000 --> 03:21:45,000
*(So why is it that... I feel like I should get involved?)*

2686
03:21:45,000 --> 03:21:49,000
*As the day drags on, a solemn atmosphere fills the cabin.*

2687
03:21:49,000 --> 03:21:57,000
*Fuyu, desperate to protect Mirari, spends her time with their injured friend, thinking up ways to fight their common enemy.*

2688
03:21:57,000 --> 03:22:09,000
*They look around the cabin for materials with which to fashion traps, talk about ways to rally the other wolves, and at all times seem to be taking the matter quite seriously.*

2689
03:22:09,000 --> 03:22:15,000
*Mirari, on the other hand, separates herself from the others and sulks on her own.*

2690
03:22:15,000 --> 03:22:24,000
*No doubt haunted by thoughts of her deceased mother, she remains silent, not saying or doing a thing as she mourns all by herself.*

2691
03:22:24,000 --> 03:22:29,000
*While the girls do as they see fit, I try to give them as much space as I can.*

2692
03:22:29,000 --> 03:22:37,000
*Contrary to how I feel, I do realize that this is a half-wolf matter, and not something which a human should get involved in.*

2693
03:22:37,000 --> 03:22:45,000
*As much as it pains me to see the gentle, kind-hearted wolf-girls in this state, I won't butt into their affairs.*

2694
03:22:45,000 --> 03:22:47,000
Mirari:  "Let us make haste, Fuyu."

2695
03:22:47,000 --> 03:22:49,000
Fuyu:  "Yes, Princess! At once!"

2696
03:22:49,000 --> 03:22:53,000
Fuyu:  "[player_name], uhm... Before we go, if you would..."

2697
03:22:53,000 --> 03:22:56,000
You:  "I'll take care of your friend."

2698
03:22:56,000 --> 03:22:59,000
You:  "Hurry back safe and sound, okay?"

2699
03:22:59,000 --> 03:23:02,000
Fuyu:  "Y-Yes! I am in your debt, human."

2700
03:23:02,000 --> 03:23:11,000
*Trying her best to remain as serious as the situation dictates, Fuyu leaves with a smile on her face as she hurries after Mirari.*

2701
03:23:11,000 --> 03:23:22,000
*Sparing only a fleeting glance as they depart, the two girls soon disappear from my sight, closing the cabin door behind them as they venture out into the snow.*

2702
03:23:22,000 --> 03:23:27,000
You:  "Phew. Mirari finally worked up the courage to face her pack, huh?"

2703
03:23:27,000 --> 03:23:31,000
You:  "I guess she wasn't really left with much choice."

2704
03:23:31,000 --> 03:23:37,000
Wolf-Girl:  "...You say that with a smile on your face, but your tone does not match your words."

2705
03:23:37,000 --> 03:23:41,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Were you hoping they would stay here instead, human?"

2706
03:23:41,000 --> 03:23:49,000
*Reminded of my new guest's presence, I grab a first-aid kit from the shelf and set it down on the living room table.*

2707
03:23:49,000 --> 03:23:55,000
*I then motion for the wolf-girl to sit down on the couch, which she does obediently.*

2708
03:23:55,000 --> 03:23:58,000
You:  "I don't know if I'd go that far..."

2709
03:23:58,000 --> 03:24:07,000
You:  "I mean, I've enjoyed having the two of them around. It's been far more lively, living with those two, and I have had fun."

2710
03:24:07,000 --> 03:24:13,000
You:  "Be that as it may... I have no intention of stopping them from returning to their pack."

2711
03:24:13,000 --> 03:24:21,000
You:  "The short time we've spent together isn't something over which I'd expect either one of them to throw away their pack."

2712
03:24:21,000 --> 03:24:26,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Huh... That is a surprisingly rational conclusion, for a human."

2713
03:24:26,000 --> 03:24:27,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Ouch!"

2714
03:24:27,000 --> 03:24:29,000
You:  "Ah, sorry. Did that hurt?"

2715
03:24:29,000 --> 03:24:31,000
Wolf-Girl:  "No... It's fine."

2716
03:24:31,000 --> 03:24:37,000
Wolf-Girl:  "These bindings of cloth will aid the recovery process, will they not?"

2717
03:24:37,000 --> 03:24:40,000
You:  "Yes, they will. They're called bandages."

2718
03:24:40,000 --> 03:24:43,000
You:  "Are you familiar with human medicine?"

2719
03:24:43,000 --> 03:24:45,000
Wolf-Girl:  "I have used it before."

2720
03:24:45,000 --> 03:24:49,000
Wolf-Girl:  "As a hunter, I must adapt as situations demand."

2721
03:24:49,000 --> 03:24:54,000
Wolf-Girl:  "When the only medicine on-hand is that of humans, I will use it."

2722
03:24:54,000 --> 03:24:55,000
You:  "I see..."

2723
03:24:55,000 --> 03:25:00,000
You:  "Come to think of it, you're accepting my aid without much of a fight."

2724
03:25:00,000 --> 03:25:08,000
You:  "Shouldn't you be a bit more wary of me? I kind of expected you to act more like Fuyu, when she first came here."

2725
03:25:08,000 --> 03:25:11,000
Wolf-Girl:  "There is no need for me to be wary."

2726
03:25:11,000 --> 03:25:16,000
*As she says that, the wolf-girl brings a single claw to my throat.*

2727
03:25:16,000 --> 03:25:22,000
Wolf-Girl:  "If you show any signs of hostility, I will kill you without a moment's hesitation."

2728
03:25:22,000 --> 03:25:24,000
You:  "Ah... haha... S-So that's it."

2729
03:25:24,000 --> 03:25:29,000
*(I stand corrected. This girl is far more wary of me than Fuyu was.)*

2730
03:25:29,000 --> 03:25:34,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Even if that was not the case, I see no reason not to trust you."

2731
03:25:34,000 --> 03:25:36,000
You:  "O-Oh? Is that so?"

2732
03:25:36,000 --> 03:25:37,000
Wolf-Girl:  "It is."

2733
03:25:37,000 --> 03:25:43,000
Wolf-Girl:  "After all, you have been taking care of the princess and Fuyu for all this time."

2734
03:25:43,000 --> 03:25:53,000
Wolf-Girl:  "What's more, both of those girls seem quite fond of you. Not just the kind-hearted princess, but even the hard-headed, human-hating Fuyu."

2735
03:25:53,000 --> 03:26:00,000
Wolf-Girl:  "If you bore us ill will, you would not be able to gain their trust to such a degree."

2736
03:26:00,000 --> 03:26:02,000
You:  "Ah. So that's it."

2737
03:26:02,000 --> 03:26:09,000
You:  "It's been difficult at times, living with those two, but I like to think that we all get along."

2738
03:26:09,000 --> 03:26:12,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Yes... "Get along", you say."

2739
03:26:12,000 --> 03:26:18,000
Wolf-Girl:  "That reminds me of the final reason why I believe I can trust you with my care."

2740
03:26:18,000 --> 03:26:19,000
You:  "There's more?"

2741
03:26:19,000 --> 03:26:22,000
You:  "You've given this quite a lot of thought."

2742
03:26:22,000 --> 03:26:28,000
Wolf-Girl:  "You should be thankful that I have. I usually kill human beings on sight."

2743
03:26:28,000 --> 03:26:29,000
You:  "{i}*gulp*{/i}"

2744
03:26:29,000 --> 03:26:31,000
You:  "S-So, the other reason is...?"

2745
03:26:31,000 --> 03:26:33,000
Wolf-Girl:  "The overpowering aroma."

2746
03:26:33,000 --> 03:26:34,000
You:  "......"

2747
03:26:34,000 --> 03:26:40,000
Wolf-Girl:  "I don't know which one you laid your hands on - perhaps it was even both."

2748
03:26:40,000 --> 03:26:50,000
Wolf-Girl:  "All I know is that, from the moment I walked in here, I've been assaulted by the smell of one or both of those girls' pheromones."

2749
03:26:50,000 --> 03:26:52,000
You:  "Ph... Pheromones...!?"

2750
03:26:52,000 --> 03:26:55,000
You:  "You don't mean... N-No, that's impossible!"

2751
03:26:55,000 --> 03:26:58,000
You:  "She was just in heat, that's all!"

2752
03:26:58,000 --> 03:27:01,000
Wolf-Girl:  "My nose doesn't lie, human."

2753
03:27:01,000 --> 03:27:08,000
*I sigh and shake my head as I finish applying bandages and disinfectant to the injured wolf-girl's wounds.*

2754
03:27:08,000 --> 03:27:10,000
You:  "Alright, that ought to do it."

2755
03:27:10,000 --> 03:27:15,000
You:  "Stay seated or lay down, your choice. Just make sure to take it easy."

2756
03:27:15,000 --> 03:27:22,000
You:  "You're welcome to stay here until you recover, as long as you don't start attacking my appliances."

2757
03:27:22,000 --> 03:27:23,000
Wolf-Girl:  "...?"

2758
03:27:23,000 --> 03:27:30,000
Wolf-Girl:  "I do not fully understand what you mean, but I shall accept your kindness nonetheless."

2759
03:27:30,000 --> 03:27:33,000
Wolf-Girl:  "You have my thanks once more, human."

2760
03:27:33,000 --> 03:27:39,000
*Leaving the injured wolf-girl's side for a moment, I return to the kitchen to take a breather.*

2761
03:27:39,000 --> 03:27:45,000
*It hasn't really sunk in yet, but the reality of the situation is, Mirari and Fuyu are gone.*

2762
03:27:45,000 --> 03:27:50,000
*Be it temporary or permanent, my wolf-girl house-guests have finally left.*

2763
03:27:50,000 --> 03:27:52,000
*(Hah... What a joke.)*

2764
03:27:52,000 --> 03:28:00,000
*(I spent all of that time worrying about whether to let them stay or not. Then, in a matter of seconds, they both disappear.)*

2765
03:28:00,000 --> 03:28:04,000
*(I feel like an idiot for thinking about all of this so much.)*

2766
03:28:04,000 --> 03:28:09,000
*I lean against the counter in the kitchen as the girls' faces come to mind.*

2767
03:28:09,000 --> 03:28:17,000
*(They vanished as quickly as they appeared. And now that they're gone, I have no way of knowing if they'll ever come back.)*

2768
03:28:17,000 --> 03:28:26,000
*(Will Mirari become the new pack leader after all? Will Fuyu succeed in trying to keep her mischievous princess under control?)*

2769
03:28:26,000 --> 03:28:35,000
*(Or will the coup succeed, leaving Mirari without the responsibility she has been so desperately trying to avoid all this time?)*

2770
03:28:35,000 --> 03:28:43,000
*As the specter of not knowing begins to loom over me, I turn my gaze towards the injured wolf-girl in the next room.*

2771
03:28:43,000 --> 03:28:51,000
*Although she's now bandaged up and looking much better than when she showed up, the girl is still clearly not well.*

2772
03:28:51,000 --> 03:28:58,000
*At that moment, I recall Fuyu's warning from the past, as well as the injured wolf-girl's story.*

2773
03:28:58,000 --> 03:29:01,000
*(No... I shouldn't jump to conclusions.)*

2774
03:29:01,000 --> 03:29:11,000
*(Those girls know their pack far better than I do. If they left, even knowing what awaited them, then it can't be as bad as what I'm imagining.)*

2775
03:29:11,000 --> 03:29:18,000
*(Besides, even in the worst case scenario, it's not like Mirari would fight the alpha male one on one.)*

2776
03:29:18,000 --> 03:29:23,000
*(Fuyu and the rest of the pack would back her up, I'm sure of it!)*

2777
03:29:23,000 --> 03:29:30,000
*(Those girls are going to be just fine. I'm sure they'll be back here paying me a visit before I know it.)*

2778
03:29:30,000 --> 03:29:35,000
*Hours quickly turn into days as I await word of Mirari and Fuyu's safety.*

2779
03:29:35,000 --> 03:29:47,000
*Left behind, I spend my days living with their injured friend, facing constant reminders that I don't share with her the same relationship that I did with Mirari and Fuyu.*

2780
03:29:47,000 --> 03:29:54,000
*Before I realize it, a week has passed, and the injured girl is well enough to return to her pack.*

2781
03:29:54,000 --> 03:30:00,000
*Just like that, I am once again left on my own, kept company only by the silence I once craved.*

2782
03:30:00,000 --> 03:30:06,000
*As time continues to pass, I am left guessing as to the fate of my former guests.*

2783
03:30:06,000 --> 03:30:12,000
*Mirari and Fuyu do not show their faces before me again, nor does the injured wolf-girl.*

2784
03:30:12,000 --> 03:30:17,000
*Whether their alive or dead, I have no way of knowing what has happened to them.*

2785
03:30:17,000 --> 03:30:21,000
*Perhaps they perished at the hands of the new alpha male.*

2786
03:30:21,000 --> 03:30:27,000
*Perhaps Mirari took the throne, leaving herself and Fuyu with no time to pay me a visit.*

2787
03:30:27,000 --> 03:30:30,000
*Whatever the case, I will never know the truth.*

2788
03:30:30,000 --> 03:30:35,000
*Those two girls are gone, and in all likelihood, I will never see them again.*

2789
03:30:35,000 --> 03:30:39,000
Fuyu:  "Hey, [player_name]. Can you come here for a second?"

2790
03:30:39,000 --> 03:30:40,000
You:  "Hmm?"

2791
03:30:40,000 --> 03:30:42,000
You:  "Sure, Fuyu. What's up?"

2792
03:30:42,000 --> 03:30:48,000
Fuyu:  "I was just wondering if we could borrow some rope, and a couple of pieces of wood."

2793
03:30:48,000 --> 03:30:50,000
You:  "To make a trap?"

2794
03:30:50,000 --> 03:30:55,000
Fuyu:  "That's right. Can't make traps without materials, you know?"

2795
03:30:55,000 --> 03:30:57,000
You:  "Take as much as you need."

2796
03:30:57,000 --> 03:30:58,000
You:  "......"

2797
03:30:58,000 --> 03:30:59,000
Fuyu:  "......"

2798
03:30:59,000 --> 03:31:00,000
You:  "So?"

2799
03:31:00,000 --> 03:31:01,000
Fuyu:  "Huh?"

2800
03:31:01,000 --> 03:31:03,000
You:  "Was there anything else?"

2801
03:31:03,000 --> 03:31:04,000
Fuyu:  "O-Oh, uhm..."

2802
03:31:04,000 --> 03:31:07,000
Fuyu:  "No, I just thought that... maybe..."

2803
03:31:07,000 --> 03:31:10,000
Fuyu:  "F-Forget it. It's not important."

2804
03:31:10,000 --> 03:31:13,000
Fuyu:  "I'll... go back to planning now."

2805
03:31:13,000 --> 03:31:18,000
*For reasons beyond my comprehension, Fuyu hesitates to leave my side.*

2806
03:31:18,000 --> 03:31:28,000
*Red in the face, she regretfully returns to her injured companion's side, then shoots one more glance in my direction before returning to work.*

2807
03:31:28,000 --> 03:31:36,000
*(Huh. I thought Mirari was the only one really shaken by all of this, but it seems Fuyu isn't quite herself either.)*

2808
03:31:36,000 --> 03:31:42,000
*(Maybe I should talk to Fuyu once she's finished planning everything out with her friend?)*

2809
03:31:42,000 --> 03:31:50,000
*(This will likely be our last night under the same roof, after all. I'd hate for anything important to be left unsaid.)*

2810
03:31:50,000 --> 03:31:55,000
*By the time Fuyu has finished making her preparations, night has already fallen.*

2811
03:31:55,000 --> 03:32:01,000
*I start to cook dinner for the four of us, once again leaving the girls to their own devices.*

2812
03:32:01,000 --> 03:32:07,000
*Surely enough, a short while later I hear the pitter-patter of stealthy footsteps behind me.*

2813
03:32:07,000 --> 03:32:11,000
You:  "It won't be ready for another 30 minutes, Fuyu."

2814
03:32:11,000 --> 03:32:12,000
Fuyu:  "Uwah!?"

2815
03:32:12,000 --> 03:32:14,000
Fuyu:  "H-How did you--"

2816
03:32:14,000 --> 03:32:21,000
You:  "Mirari wouldn't try to sneak up on me like that. Or eat half-cooked food, for that matter."

2817
03:32:21,000 --> 03:32:28,000
You:  "And the other girl is too injured to sneak around so quietly, so I figured it couldn't be her."

2818
03:32:28,000 --> 03:32:30,000
*I turn my head as I address Fuyu.*

2819
03:32:30,000 --> 03:32:33,000
*While doing so, I finally realize something.*

2820
03:32:33,000 --> 03:32:35,000
You:  "Say... where are those two?"

2821
03:32:35,000 --> 03:32:38,000
Fuyu:  "They've both gone in for a bath."

2822
03:32:38,000 --> 03:32:46,000
Fuyu:  "Mirari insisted that the wounds should be cleaned properly, so it seems like they might be in there for a while."

2823
03:32:46,000 --> 03:32:48,000
You:  "Hmm, is that right?"

2824
03:32:48,000 --> 03:32:53,000
You:  "Well, whatever. I'm sure Mirari could use a distraction right now."

2825
03:32:53,000 --> 03:32:55,000
Fuyu:  "Yes... Perhaps so."

2826
03:32:55,000 --> 03:33:01,000
*Returning to the task at hand, I turn away from Fuyu and continue chopping up the potatoes.*

2827
03:33:01,000 --> 03:33:02,000
Fuyu:  "......"

2828
03:33:02,000 --> 03:33:04,000
Fuyu:  "H-Hey, [player_name]."

2829
03:33:04,000 --> 03:33:07,000
You:  "No. You can't have any until it's cooked."

2830
03:33:07,000 --> 03:33:08,000
Fuyu:  "That's--"

2831
03:33:08,000 --> 03:33:11,000
Fuyu:  "...Not what I was going to ask."

2832
03:33:11,000 --> 03:33:16,000
*Suddenly adopting a solemn tone of voice, Fuyu pinches the hem of my shirt.*

2833
03:33:16,000 --> 03:33:18,000
Fuyu:  "[player_name], uhm..."

2834
03:33:18,000 --> 03:33:21,000
Fuyu:  "Do you remember the night when I... erm..."

2835
03:33:21,000 --> 03:33:23,000
Fuyu:  "...Imposed on you?"

2836
03:33:23,000 --> 03:33:26,000
You:  "You mean when you went into heat?"

2837
03:33:26,000 --> 03:33:28,000
Fuyu:  "Wah!? N-No, I wasn't...!"

2838
03:33:28,000 --> 03:33:34,000
You:  "It's nothing to be embarrassed about. I know that it isn't something you can control."

2839
03:33:34,000 --> 03:33:36,000
You:  "So, what about it?"

2840
03:33:36,000 --> 03:33:37,000
Fuyu:  "......"

2841
03:33:37,000 --> 03:33:40,000
Fuyu:  "If... If I came to you like that again..."

2842
03:33:40,000 --> 03:33:42,000
Fuyu:  "What would you do?"

2843
03:33:42,000 --> 03:33:49,000
*I place the knife in my hand down on the chopping board, then turn around to face Fuyu properly.*

2844
03:33:49,000 --> 03:33:55,000
*When I do, I realize that Fuyu is fidgeting restlessly, and her face is beet red.*

2845
03:33:55,000 --> 03:33:58,000
You:  "That's an, uhh... unexpected question."

2846
03:33:58,000 --> 03:34:04,000
You:  "I guess I could help you out again, if you're okay with me being your partner."

2847
03:34:04,000 --> 03:34:13,000
You:  "I don't know if we'll be able to do that though. With an extra person here, it might be difficult to do that undetected."

2848
03:34:13,000 --> 03:34:16,000
Fuyu:  "...It doesn't have to be tonight."

2849
03:34:16,000 --> 03:34:17,000
You:  "Huh?"

2850
03:34:17,000 --> 03:34:20,000
You:  "But you're leaving tomorrow, aren't you?"

2851
03:34:20,000 --> 03:34:22,000
You:  "If not tonight, then--"

2852
03:34:22,000 --> 03:34:25,000
Fuyu:  "I-I'm going to return here, okay!?"

2853
03:34:25,000 --> 03:34:33,000
Fuyu:  "Once the princess and I have done what we need to, I'm going to come back here, whether you want me here or not!"

2854
03:34:33,000 --> 03:34:38,000
Fuyu:  "We're going to do what we did last time... No, we'll go even further!"

2855
03:34:38,000 --> 03:34:41,000
Fuyu:  "Because... you know... uhm..."

2856
03:34:41,000 --> 03:34:44,000
Fuyu:  "I've already... chosen you..."

2857
03:34:44,000 --> 03:34:45,000
You:  "Chosen me...?"

2858
03:34:45,000 --> 03:34:48,000
You:  "I don't understand. Chosen me for what?"

2859
03:34:48,000 --> 03:34:52,000
Fuyu:  "Ahh, geez! Can't you figure it out for yourself?"

2860
03:34:52,000 --> 03:34:55,000
Fuyu:  "This is why I can't stand humans!"

2861
03:34:55,000 --> 03:35:06,000
Fuyu:  "Listen here, [player_name]! Once the princess and I have fulfilled our duty, I'm going to come straight back here, and we'll continue this conversation!"

2862
03:35:06,000 --> 03:35:07,000
Fuyu:  "Until then..."

2863
03:35:07,000 --> 03:35:09,000
Fuyu:  "...Wait for me, okay?"

2864
03:35:09,000 --> 03:35:13,000
*Before I can ask Fuyu to elaborate, she quietly slinks away.*

2865
03:35:13,000 --> 03:35:22,000
*Fuyu returns to the couch a moment before her fellow wolf-girls leave the bathroom, giving me no opportunity to probe any further.*

2866
03:35:22,000 --> 03:35:26,000
*(Until this incident comes to an end, all I can do is speculate.)*

2867
03:35:26,000 --> 03:35:32,000
*(That being said, perhaps I'd be better off waiting for Fuyu to just tell me herself.)*

2868
03:35:32,000 --> 03:35:37,000
*(Right now, going off what she's said to me, it almost sounds like...)*

2869
03:35:37,000 --> 03:35:39,000
*(She wants me to become her mate.)*

2870
03:35:39,000 --> 03:35:42,000
Mirari:  "Excuse me... [player_name]?"

2871
03:35:42,000 --> 03:35:45,000
Mirari:  "May I speak to you for a moment?"

2872
03:35:45,000 --> 03:35:47,000
You:  "Oh, Mirari. There you are."

2873
03:35:47,000 --> 03:35:48,000
You:  "What's up?"

2874
03:35:48,000 --> 03:35:52,000
Mirari:  "I just... wanted to speak to you about something."

2875
03:35:52,000 --> 03:35:54,000
Mirari:  "...In private."

2876
03:35:54,000 --> 03:35:58,000
*I look past Mirari and over to the other wolf-girls.*

2877
03:35:58,000 --> 03:36:07,000
*Fuyu and the injured wolf-girl are both busy looking over a map I lent them, and appear to be completely absorbed in what they're doing.*

2878
03:36:07,000 --> 03:36:13,000
You:  "We could probably just talk about it here. Those two seem to be pretty distracted."

2879
03:36:13,000 --> 03:36:16,000
Mirari:  "I... Yes, I suppose you're right."

2880
03:36:16,000 --> 03:36:17,000
Mirari:  "Even so..."

2881
03:36:17,000 --> 03:36:20,000
*Mirari looks down at her feet in dejection.*

2882
03:36:20,000 --> 03:36:29,000
*Whatever she wants to talk to me about, it seems like it really isn't something she's comfortable talking about in front of others.*

2883
03:36:29,000 --> 03:36:30,000
You:  "...Alright."

2884
03:36:30,000 --> 03:36:34,000
You:  "Why don't we go into my room and talk in there?"

2885
03:36:34,000 --> 03:36:35,000
Mirari:  "Can we?"

2886
03:36:35,000 --> 03:36:39,000
Mirari:  "I-I mean, only if it isn't too much trouble..."

2887
03:36:39,000 --> 03:36:42,000
You:  "It's no trouble. Just let me--"

2888
03:36:42,000 --> 03:36:46,000
Fuyu:  "Hey, [player_name]. Can I borrow you for a second?"

2889
03:36:46,000 --> 03:36:48,000
You:  "Ah... hold on a minute."

2890
03:36:48,000 --> 03:36:52,000
You:  "Can this wait, Fuyu? Mirari and I were just about to--"

2891
03:36:52,000 --> 03:36:55,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Did you ask about the rope?"

2892
03:36:55,000 --> 03:36:59,000
Fuyu:  "Give me a minute, would you? That's what I'm asking about."

2893
03:36:59,000 --> 03:37:06,000
Fuyu:  "So, [player_name]. We were just thinking about traps we could set up, and it seems like..."

2894
03:37:06,000 --> 03:37:11,000
*Fuyu intercepts me the moment I'm about to leave the room with Mirari.*

2895
03:37:11,000 --> 03:37:15,000
*Seeing this, Mirari breathes a small sigh, then tugs on my shirt.*

2896
03:37:15,000 --> 03:37:17,000
Mirari:  "...I'll be waiting."

2897
03:37:17,000 --> 03:37:20,000
Fuyu:  "So, anyway, about those traps..."

2898
03:37:20,000 --> 03:37:26,000
*After supplying Fuyu with the information and materials she needs, I begin my trek outside.*

2899
03:37:26,000 --> 03:37:35,000
*Even though it's snowing a bit, it doesn't take long before I spot Mirari's footsteps in the snow, leading a short ways from the house.*

2900
03:37:35,000 --> 03:37:41,000
*Standing at the edge of the forest is Mirari, who seems to be off in her own little world.*

2901
03:37:41,000 --> 03:37:42,000
You:  "Mirari...?"

2902
03:37:42,000 --> 03:37:43,000
Mirari:  "Hyah!?"

2903
03:37:43,000 --> 03:37:45,000
Mirari:  "O-Oh... [player_name]."

2904
03:37:45,000 --> 03:37:48,000
Mirari:  "I didn't hear you approaching."

2905
03:37:48,000 --> 03:37:52,000
You:  "So? What was it that you wanted to talk to me about?"

2906
03:37:52,000 --> 03:37:58,000
You:  "It must be pretty serious if you don't want to talk about it in front of your own pack."

2907
03:37:58,000 --> 03:38:05,000
Mirari:  "...It is precisely {i}because{/i} they are my pack that I do not wish for them to hear this."

2908
03:38:05,000 --> 03:38:06,000
You:  "Hmm?"

2909
03:38:06,000 --> 03:38:13,000
Mirari:  "[player_name], I've given this a lot of thought... especially after hearing of my mother's fate."

2910
03:38:13,000 --> 03:38:19,000
Mirari:  "The truth is... I don't think I have what it takes to be the pack leader."

2911
03:38:19,000 --> 03:38:21,000
Mirari:  "At least... not on my own."

2912
03:38:21,000 --> 03:38:27,000
*Mirari, who was concentrating on her feet a moment ago, looks me dead in the eye.*

2913
03:38:27,000 --> 03:38:31,000
Mirari:  "[player_name]... I want you to join my pack."

2914
03:38:31,000 --> 03:38:32,000
You:  "...Huh?"

2915
03:38:32,000 --> 03:38:36,000
You:  "You want me, a human, to join a pack of half-wolves?"

2916
03:38:36,000 --> 03:38:37,000
Mirari:  "I do."

2917
03:38:37,000 --> 03:38:39,000
You:  "You're kidding me."

2918
03:38:39,000 --> 03:38:42,000
*I try to laugh off Mirari's comment.*

2919
03:38:42,000 --> 03:38:48,000
*However, Mirari shows no amusement on her face, nor does she appear to be joking.*

2920
03:38:48,000 --> 03:38:51,000
You:  "You really want me to join you?"

2921
03:38:51,000 --> 03:38:53,000
Mirari:  "That's right."

2922
03:38:53,000 --> 03:38:54,000
You:  "...Why?"

2923
03:38:54,000 --> 03:38:57,000
You:  "I'm a human. I don't belong in your pack."

2924
03:38:57,000 --> 03:39:04,000
You:  "Besides, even if you and Fuyu have warmed up to me, the rest of your pack won't accept me so easily."

2925
03:39:04,000 --> 03:39:09,000
Mirari:  "Once I become the pack leader, it won't matter what they think of you."

2926
03:39:09,000 --> 03:39:14,000
Mirari:  "Nobody would dare to speak ill of the pack leader's mate."

2927
03:39:14,000 --> 03:39:16,000
You:  "The pack leader's... what?"

2928
03:39:16,000 --> 03:39:17,000
Mirari:  "Ah..."

2929
03:39:17,000 --> 03:39:22,000
*Mirari quickly covers her mouth with her hands as her face turns bright red.*

2930
03:39:22,000 --> 03:39:24,000
Mirari:  "N-No, I... That is..."

2931
03:39:24,000 --> 03:39:29,000
*Mirari begins to squirm as she casts her eyes towards her feet once more.*

2932
03:39:29,000 --> 03:39:33,000
*Still red in the face, Mirari looks up at me with upturned eyes.*

2933
03:39:33,000 --> 03:39:36,000
Mirari:  "...Would that... really be so bad?"

2934
03:39:36,000 --> 03:39:43,000
Mirari:  "You said last time that it's okay as long as there's love, a-and I... really do... uhm..."

2935
03:39:43,000 --> 03:39:49,000
*Mirari's voice becomes barely audible as she forces herself to continue speaking.*

2936
03:39:49,000 --> 03:39:52,000
Mirari:  "A-Anyway, that's what I've been thinking!"

2937
03:39:52,000 --> 03:39:58,000
Mirari:  "So please, [player_name], take your time and think about what I've said!"

2938
03:39:58,000 --> 03:40:02,000
*Suddenly full of life once more, Mirari exits in a hurry.*

2939
03:40:02,000 --> 03:40:09,000
*Covering her face with her hands, she runs towards the cabin, quickly disappearing from my sight.*

2940
03:40:09,000 --> 03:40:16,000
*As she runs off, all I can do is sit there, shocked, unable to fully comprehend what has just happened.*

2941
03:40:16,000 --> 03:40:19,000
*(I... must have heard Mirari wrong.)*

2942
03:40:19,000 --> 03:40:24,000
*(There's no way that what she said just now was what she honestly feels.)*

2943
03:40:24,000 --> 03:40:34,000
*(I mean... if I were to take everything Mirari said just now at face value, and took her words literally, then the logical conclusion would be that...)*

2944
03:40:34,000 --> 03:40:35,000
*(She loves me.)*

2945
03:40:35,000 --> 03:40:41,000
*As the morning sun rises, the inhabitants of my cabin all wake up bright and early.*

2946
03:40:41,000 --> 03:40:51,000
*Following breakfast, some last-minute planning, and a few concerned comments from the only human present, we all meet in the living room one more time.*

2947
03:40:51,000 --> 03:41:00,000
Wolf-Girl:  "I don't mean to rush you, Princess, but if you are planning to lay traps before the confrontation, you'd best hurry."

2948
03:41:00,000 --> 03:41:06,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Time is of the essence. Your opponent will not wait for you to gather your wits."

2949
03:41:06,000 --> 03:41:08,000
Mirari:  "Yes... I know."

2950
03:41:08,000 --> 03:41:10,000
Mirari:  "We will leave momentarily."

2951
03:41:10,000 --> 03:41:13,000
Mirari:  "Fuyu, are you prepared to leave?"

2952
03:41:13,000 --> 03:41:16,000
Fuyu:  "Yes, Princess. I am ready whenever you are."

2953
03:41:16,000 --> 03:41:20,000
Mirari:  "Excellent. In that case, we will not dally any longer."

2954
03:41:20,000 --> 03:41:23,000
*Smiling resolutely, Mirari turns to face me.*

2955
03:41:23,000 --> 03:41:25,000
Mirari:  "[player_name]."

2956
03:41:25,000 --> 03:41:26,000
You:  "Yes, Mirari?"

2957
03:41:26,000 --> 03:41:33,000
Mirari:  "While it pains me to leave you like this, I promise that our parting will not be for long."

2958
03:41:33,000 --> 03:41:42,000
Mirari:  "The kindness you have shown me until now shall not be forgotten, nor will I ever regret the time we have spent together."

2959
03:41:42,000 --> 03:41:46,000
Mirari:  "As soon as I am able, I shall come back here to see you."

2960
03:41:46,000 --> 03:41:49,000
You:  "Of course. You're welcome any time."

2961
03:41:49,000 --> 03:41:53,000
You:  "The same goes for you, Fuyu. Don't be a stranger."

2962
03:41:53,000 --> 03:41:59,000
Mirari:  "Well then, if nothing more needs to be said, I believe it is time for us to head off."

2963
03:41:59,000 --> 03:42:05,000
Mirari:  "We will be back as soon as we are able. However, should the worst happen--"

2964
03:42:05,000 --> 03:42:07,000
You:  "Don't finish that sentence."

2965
03:42:07,000 --> 03:42:14,000
You:  "You're both going to be fine. In fact, I'm sure you'll be back here pestering me in no time."

2966
03:42:14,000 --> 03:42:16,000
Mirari:  "...I do hope so."

2967
03:42:16,000 --> 03:42:21,000
*Bowing her head respectfully, Mirari turns around with a smile on her face.*

2968
03:42:21,000 --> 03:42:28,000
*Fuyu, carrying some supplies I lent the girls, mimics Mirari's action, then follows straight after her.*

2969
03:42:28,000 --> 03:42:34,000
*Mirari opens the door, ushering Fuyu out first, then follows her out into the snow.*

2970
03:42:34,000 --> 03:42:40,000
*A moment later, the door is shut. And all at once... silence consumes the cabin once more.*

2971
03:42:40,000 --> 03:42:48,000
*Left in the company of the injured wolf-girl, I find myself pacing restlessly around the cabin as time slowly passes by.*

2972
03:42:48,000 --> 03:42:54,000
*Watching the clock, waiting for something to happen, praying that the girls will be okay.*

2973
03:42:54,000 --> 03:43:00,000
*I can't bring myself to relax, or to focus on anything unrelated to the wolf-girls' plight.*

2974
03:43:00,000 --> 03:43:05,000
*All I can do is curse my own inactivity as I worry about my former guests.*

2975
03:43:05,000 --> 03:43:09,000
*(Damn it... Why am I getting so worked up over this?)*

2976
03:43:09,000 --> 03:43:18,000
*(The girls are going to be fine. They've been planning their attack carefully, and the traitor has no idea that they're coming for him.)*

2977
03:43:18,000 --> 03:43:26,000
*(They have my map, some crude traps that they made, and probably even the support of those who followed Mirari's parents.)*

2978
03:43:26,000 --> 03:43:29,000
*(This should all be a walk in the park.)*

2979
03:43:29,000 --> 03:43:30,000
*(So why do I...)*

2980
03:43:30,000 --> 03:43:34,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Oh, for goodness' sake. Just go already."

2981
03:43:34,000 --> 03:43:39,000
*I almost jump in surprise as my remaining guest suddenly piped up.*

2982
03:43:39,000 --> 03:43:41,000
You:  "E... Excuse me?"

2983
03:43:41,000 --> 03:43:43,000
Wolf-Girl:  "You heard me."

2984
03:43:43,000 --> 03:43:50,000
Wolf-Girl:  "You've been pacing around with that worried look on your face ever since those two left."

2985
03:43:50,000 --> 03:43:57,000
Wolf-Girl:  "If you're just going to spend the entire time worrying about them, why don't you chase after them?"

2986
03:43:57,000 --> 03:44:06,000
Wolf-Girl:  "They should still be setting up, assuming they've even arrived yet. If you hurry, you should be able to catch up to them."

2987
03:44:06,000 --> 03:44:08,000
*I shake my head and sigh.*

2988
03:44:08,000 --> 03:44:10,000
You:  "I can't do that."

2989
03:44:10,000 --> 03:44:15,000
You:  "This is a half-wolf matter. A human like me shouldn't get involved."

2990
03:44:15,000 --> 03:44:19,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Oh, please. It's a little late to be saying that now."

2991
03:44:19,000 --> 03:44:23,000
Wolf-Girl:  "You're already involved, whether you like it or not."

2992
03:44:23,000 --> 03:44:28,000
*The injured wolf-girl sits up on the couch and looks directly into my eyes.*

2993
03:44:28,000 --> 03:44:38,000
Wolf-Girl:  "I don't know what's gone on between the three of you in this cabin, but the smell of pheromones coming from those girls is overwhelming."

2994
03:44:38,000 --> 03:44:45,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Even if they won't admit it, I'm sure that at least one of them has their eyes set on you."

2995
03:44:45,000 --> 03:44:51,000
Wolf-Girl:  "As soon as you take one of them as your mate, you'll be part of our pack anyway."

2996
03:44:51,000 --> 03:44:55,000
*My eyes open wide as the wolf-girl's words begin to register.*

2997
03:44:55,000 --> 03:45:06,000
*Despite my insistence that I'm unrelated to this pack business, and that I should keep my nose out of their affairs, it seems the girls do not feel the same way.*

2998
03:45:06,000 --> 03:45:08,000
*(Take one of them as my mate...)*

2999
03:45:08,000 --> 03:45:10,000
*(It couldn't be... could it?)*

3000
03:45:10,000 --> 03:45:11,000
*(No way.)*

3001
03:45:11,000 --> 03:45:16,000
Wolf-Girl:  "It looks like you already know what I'm talking about."

3002
03:45:16,000 --> 03:45:22,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Why not end your suffering and go after them? I'm sure they'll be happy to see you."

3003
03:45:22,000 --> 03:45:24,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Besides..."

3004
03:45:24,000 --> 03:45:27,000
*The wolf-girl's eyes suddenly narrow.*

3005
03:45:27,000 --> 03:45:31,000
Wolf-Girl:  "They're going to need all the help they can get."

3006
03:45:31,000 --> 03:45:32,000
You:  "They... what?"

3007
03:45:32,000 --> 03:45:34,000
You:  "What do you mean by that?"

3008
03:45:34,000 --> 03:45:36,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Exactly what I said."

3009
03:45:36,000 --> 03:45:44,000
Wolf-Girl:  "We made all of the preparations we could in a short amount of time, but I doubt that it'll be enough."

3010
03:45:44,000 --> 03:45:53,000
Wolf-Girl:  "If it comes down to a direct confrontation between those two and the traitor, they will without a doubt be slaughtered."

3011
03:45:53,000 --> 03:45:54,000
You:  "Slaughtered!?"

3012
03:45:54,000 --> 03:45:58,000
You:  "N-No, but... Mirari's the rightful heir, isn't she?"

3013
03:45:58,000 --> 03:46:03,000
You:  "Surely he'll give up, or the other members of the pack will help them."

3014
03:46:03,000 --> 03:46:06,000
Wolf-Girl:  "I wouldn't count on that."

3015
03:46:06,000 --> 03:46:13,000
Wolf-Girl:  "The second he sees the princess, he will kill her, no matter who is around to witness such an act."

3016
03:46:13,000 --> 03:46:23,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Our pack responds to strength above all else. If the princess cannot defeat a potential usurper, then she will not be accepted anyway."

3017
03:46:23,000 --> 03:46:28,000
You:  "No way... I thought facing that guy was a last resort, not a necessity!"

3018
03:46:28,000 --> 03:46:33,000
You:  "If those two have to fight him by themselves, they'll be...!"

3019
03:46:33,000 --> 03:46:38,000
*Without another moment of thought, I run towards the storeroom and grab my axe.*

3020
03:46:38,000 --> 03:46:45,000
*In response to my sudden action, the injured wolf-girl smiles at me sincerely for the first time.*

3021
03:46:45,000 --> 03:46:47,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Best of luck, human."

3022
03:46:47,000 --> 03:46:52,000
Wolf-Girl:  "Go and protect your mate, no matter what hardship lies in your wake."

3023
03:46:52,000 --> 03:46:59,000
*Without sparing a moment to respond to the girl's words, I nod absentmindedly and rush out of the living room.*

3024
03:46:59,000 --> 03:47:04,000
*I jump into my truck, placing my axe on my lap, and start the engine.*

3025
03:47:04,000 --> 03:47:15,000
*Before the injured girl can react to the noise of the engine, I drive out into the snow, throwing caution to the wind as I follow the path Fuyu once led me down.*

3026
03:47:15,000 --> 03:47:19,000
*(Alright, this should be it. If I recall, the path up here is...)*

3027
03:47:19,000 --> 03:47:25,000
*Where there was once a pile of snow blocking the path, there is now level ground.*

3028
03:47:25,000 --> 03:47:31,000
*Whether someone cleared it out, or nature has simply taken its course, I don't know.*

3029
03:47:31,000 --> 03:47:37,000
*All I care about is the fact that I can keep driving, right into the den of Fuyu and Mirari.*

3030
03:47:37,000 --> 03:47:40,000
You:  "Wait for me, girls. I'm coming!"

3031
03:47:40,000 --> 03:47:47,000
*I continue to drive through the snow, no longer sure of which direction I'm supposed to be heading.*

3032
03:47:47,000 --> 03:47:58,000
*Having never gone this far around the mountain before, I have no way of knowing if I'm heading towards the girls' den, or in the complete opposite direction.*

3033
03:47:58,000 --> 03:48:01,000
You:  "Damn it... What did that map say again?"

3034
03:48:01,000 --> 03:48:05,000
You:  "Argh, I knew I should have kept it in the truck!"

3035
03:48:05,000 --> 03:48:10,000
*Just as frustration threatens to take over, I notice something in the distance.*

3036
03:48:10,000 --> 03:48:18,000
*A few figures are moving around in the snow. Two of them are quickly circling one another, while the third takes distance.*

3037
03:48:18,000 --> 03:48:21,000
*As I grow closer, I recognize two of the figures.*

3038
03:48:21,000 --> 03:48:22,000
You:  "Fuyu! Mirari!"

3039
03:48:22,000 --> 03:48:24,000
You:  "And... that must be..."

3040
03:48:24,000 --> 03:48:28,000
*I clutch the axe resting on my lap as I focus on the third party.*

3041
03:48:28,000 --> 03:48:34,000
*Facing off against Fuyu is a large creature, more wolf than man, easily several times her size.*

3042
03:48:34,000 --> 03:48:41,000
*Fuyu is fighting, but clearly tired. Against the giant towering over her, she doesn't stand a chance.*

3043
03:48:41,000 --> 03:48:43,000
You:  "Shit... Shit, shit, shit!"

3044
03:48:43,000 --> 03:48:49,000
*Rather than slow down, I press my foot against the accelerator even harder than before.*

3045
03:48:49,000 --> 03:48:57,000
*My truck increases in speed, threatening to spin out of control at any moment, as I rapidly approach my target.*

3046
03:48:57,000 --> 03:48:58,000
You:  "Fuyu, jump!"

3047
03:48:58,000 --> 03:48:59,000
Fuyu:  "Wah...!?"

3048
03:48:59,000 --> 03:49:04,000
*Jumping out of the way just in time, Fuyu narrowly avoids being hit by my truck.*

3049
03:49:04,000 --> 03:49:07,000
*Her opponent, however, is not so lucky.*

3050
03:49:07,000 --> 03:49:10,000
You:  "Shit... I'm losing control of the wheel!"

3051
03:49:10,000 --> 03:49:11,000
You:  "Damn it all!"

3052
03:49:11,000 --> 03:49:17,000
*Without a moment to spare, I undo my seatbelt, grab my axe, and bail out of the truck.*

3053
03:49:17,000 --> 03:49:26,000
*A few seconds later, the truck swerves off the side of the mountain, descending who knows how many miles before meeting its untimely demise.*

3054
03:49:26,000 --> 03:49:29,000
You:  "{i}haa... haa...{/i} T-Talk later!"

3055
03:49:29,000 --> 03:49:35,000
You:  "I hit him pretty hard, but I don't think it'll be enough to kill that bastard."

3056
03:49:35,000 --> 03:49:40,000
*As if responding to my words, I feel a presence manifest behind me.*

3057
03:49:40,000 --> 03:49:45,000
*I turn around, swinging my axe wildly, hoping to nail the wolf in the head.*

3058
03:49:45,000 --> 03:49:48,000
*Unfortunately, my luck appears to have run out.*

3059
03:49:48,000 --> 03:49:50,000
Alpha:  "WRRAAARRGGHH!"

3060
03:49:50,000 --> 03:49:52,000
Alpha:  "HUMAN FILTH!!"

3061
03:49:52,000 --> 03:49:53,000
You:  "Kuh...!!"

3062
03:49:53,000 --> 03:49:57,000
*My axe strikes the wolf in what I assume to be his ribcage.*

3063
03:49:57,000 --> 03:50:01,000
*Unfortunately, my attack only serves to enrage the beast.*

3064
03:50:01,000 --> 03:50:07,000
*The next moment, he swipes his mighty claws sideways, ripping the axe from my hands.*

3065
03:50:07,000 --> 03:50:13,000
*Before I can so much as reach for my weapon, the wolf pounces on me, pinning me to the ground.*

3066
03:50:13,000 --> 03:50:14,000
Alpha:  "DIE, HUMAN!!"

3067
03:50:14,000 --> 03:50:15,000
You:  "Ah..."

3068
03:50:15,000 --> 03:50:18,000
*My eyes widen as the wolf raises its claw.*

3069
03:50:18,000 --> 03:50:26,000
*Pinned to the ground with no hope of escape, I watch in terror as the lumbering, razor-sharp appendage is swung down.*

3070
03:50:26,000 --> 03:50:35,000
*With more weight and precision behind it than I would dare to imagine, time appears to slow to a halt as deaths beckons to me all too soon.*

3071
03:50:35,000 --> 03:50:37,000
Alpha:  "GUH! STUPID LITTLE..."

3072
03:50:37,000 --> 03:50:38,000
Alpha:  "COME HERE!"

3073
03:50:38,000 --> 03:50:39,000
Mirari:  "Guh...!"

3074
03:50:39,000 --> 03:50:40,000
Fuyu:  "Princess!"

3075
03:50:40,000 --> 03:50:43,000
Fuyu:  "You'll pay for that, traitor!"

3076
03:50:43,000 --> 03:50:49,000
*The moment I reside myself to death, I open my eyes to find an unbelievable sight.*

3077
03:50:49,000 --> 03:50:59,000
*Despite the difference in their size, and the sheer hopelessness of our situation, Mirari and Fuyu are desperately fighting off the alpha male.*

3078
03:50:59,000 --> 03:51:01,000
You:  "Y... You girls..."

3079
03:51:01,000 --> 03:51:06,000
You:  "...What are you doing!? You should have taken the opportunity to run away!"

3080
03:51:06,000 --> 03:51:09,000
*I rise to my feet, grabbing my axe as I do.*

3081
03:51:09,000 --> 03:51:10,000
*{i}*thunk*{/i}*

3082
03:51:10,000 --> 03:51:12,000
Alpha:  "WRRAAARRGGHH!!"

3083
03:51:12,000 --> 03:51:14,000
Alpha:  "THE HUMAN AGAIN!"

3084
03:51:14,000 --> 03:51:17,000
Alpha:  "DIE, YOU MISERABLE PIECE OF--"

3085
03:51:17,000 --> 03:51:18,000
*{i}*whack*{/i}*

3086
03:51:18,000 --> 03:51:19,000
Alpha:  "GRRRNNN...!!"

3087
03:51:19,000 --> 03:51:27,000
*With the two wolf-girls holding our opponent back, I land two clear, heavy blows straight to the alpha male's head.*

3088
03:51:27,000 --> 03:51:35,000
*It isn't enough to knock him unconscious, but for the first time since the girls engaged him, he appears to be weakening.*

3089
03:51:35,000 --> 03:51:40,000
*Unfortunately, his strength is still too much for the girls to bear.*

3090
03:51:40,000 --> 03:51:50,000
*The two of them are tossed about as though they are weightless, using all of their strength to merely hang off the wolf's limbs as he moves about.*

3091
03:51:50,000 --> 03:51:54,000
*Pain spreads on the girls faces. They won't last much longer.*

3092
03:51:54,000 --> 03:51:56,000
You:  "You bastard...!"

3093
03:51:56,000 --> 03:51:58,000
You:  "Take your hands off her!"

3094
03:51:58,000 --> 03:51:59,000
*{i}*whack*{/i}*

3095
03:51:59,000 --> 03:52:00,000
Alpha:  "HNNNGGG...!!"

3096
03:52:00,000 --> 03:52:02,000
Alpha:  "YOU... WORTHLESS..."

3097
03:52:02,000 --> 03:52:03,000
*{i}*whack*{/i}*

3098
03:52:03,000 --> 03:52:04,000
Alpha:  "KUH...!!"

3099
03:52:04,000 --> 03:52:12,000
*I strike the wolf again and again, ignoring every warning my body gives me as I push myself far beyond my limits.*

3100
03:52:12,000 --> 03:52:20,000
*My axe splinters, but remains in one piece. Even as it collides with the wolf's thick skull, it somehow avoids destruction.*

3101
03:52:20,000 --> 03:52:24,000
*Only good for one more strike, I raise the axe over my head--*

3102
03:52:24,000 --> 03:52:27,000
*And put an end to the fight, once and for all.*

3103
03:52:27,000 --> 03:52:29,000
You:  "{i}haa... haa... haa...{/i}"

3104
03:52:29,000 --> 03:52:33,000
You:  "Not... Not so tough now... {i}haa...{/i} are you...?"

3105
03:52:33,000 --> 03:52:38,000
*Barely able to stand, I limp over to the unconscious wolf's ragged body.*

3106
03:52:38,000 --> 03:52:47,000
*Wielding half of a wooden axe, which is now only good for stabbing prey with the broken end, I bring my weapon to the wolf's face.*

3107
03:52:47,000 --> 03:52:49,000
Mirari:  "[player_name], stop!"

3108
03:52:49,000 --> 03:52:52,000
Mirari:  "Please, that's... that's enough!"

3109
03:52:52,000 --> 03:52:54,000
Fuyu:  "The princess is right."

3110
03:52:54,000 --> 03:52:59,000
Fuyu:  "[player_name], lower your weapon. The pack will take care of the rest."

3111
03:52:59,000 --> 03:53:03,000
*Turning to face the girls, I regrettably drop my weapon.*

3112
03:53:03,000 --> 03:53:09,000
*Even if I wanted to finish our opponent off, the truth is, I don't have the strength.*

3113
03:53:09,000 --> 03:53:17,000
*Be it the loss of blood, my overwhelming exhaustion, or a rare chink in the wall around my heart, I respond thusly.*

3114
03:53:17,000 --> 03:53:21,000
You:  "How could I not come when my mate was in danger?"

3115
03:53:21,000 --> 03:53:26,000
*While their pack carts off the alpha male, Mirari, Fuyu and I take our leave.*

3116
03:53:26,000 --> 03:53:34,000
*We slowly trudge through the snow, heading back to my cabin with clear exhaustion and relief painted all over our faces.*

3117
03:53:34,000 --> 03:53:35,000
*Finally, it's over.*

3118
03:53:35,000 --> 03:53:42,000
*She tells the injured girl of everything that happened, including the many embarrassing things that were said.*

3119
03:53:42,000 --> 03:53:47,000
*Thankfully, by the time she gets to that part, I have already left the room.*

3120
03:53:47,000 --> 03:53:49,000
You:  "So... here we are again."

3121
03:53:49,000 --> 03:53:55,000
You:  "I'm going to ask this once, just to make sure, but... are you really okay with this?"

3122
03:53:55,000 --> 03:54:00,000
Mirari:  "This time for sure, I'm going to make you mine, [player_name]."

3123
03:54:00,000 --> 03:54:04,000
*She kisses me. Slowly at first, but growing in speed and force.*

3124
03:54:04,000 --> 03:54:08,000
*I feel her wrap her arms around me and pull me towards her.*

3125
03:54:08,000 --> 03:54:13,000
*I feel hands press against my hips – Urging me to move towards the bed.*

3126
03:54:13,000 --> 03:54:14,000
You:  "Woah!"

3127
03:54:14,000 --> 03:54:20,000
*Surprised by her forcefulness, I fall onto the bed as Mirari brings me down on top of her.*

3128
03:54:20,000 --> 03:54:27,000
*Behind her blushing cheeks and smiling lips, there's fierce determination hidden in Mirari's eyes.*

3129
03:54:27,000 --> 03:54:29,000
Mirari:  "Haa... ha..."

3130
03:54:29,000 --> 03:54:31,000
You:  "Go easy on me..."

3131
03:54:31,000 --> 03:54:36,000
Mirari:  "I'm sorry, but I don't think that's going to be possible."

3132
03:54:36,000 --> 03:54:42,000
*She begins pulling at the straps on my jacket, and starting to remove it from my body.*

3133
03:54:42,000 --> 03:54:44,000
Mirari:  "Let’s get this off."

